        "verse_number": 42,
        "verse_title": "Genesis 27:42",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 27:42",
        "scripture_text": "And these words of Esau her elder son were told to Rebekah: and she sent and called Jacob her younger son, and said unto him, Behold, thy brother Esau, as touching thee, doth comfort himself, purposing to kill thee."
