        "book_title": "Genesis",
        "book_short_title": "Gen.",
        "chapter_number": 32,
        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "Genesis 32:2",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 32:2",
        "scripture_text": "And when Jacob saw them, he said, This is God's host: and he called the name of that place Mahanaim."
