        "book_title": "Genesis",
        "book_short_title": "Gen.",
        "chapter_number": 32,
        "verse_number": 10,
        "verse_title": "Genesis 32:10",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 32:10",
        "scripture_text": "I am not worthy of the least of all the mercies, and of all the truth, which thou hast shewed unto thy servant; for with my staff I passed over this Jordan; and now I am become two bands."
