        "book_short_title": "Gen.",
        "chapter_number": 35,
        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "Genesis 35:2",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 35:2",
        "scripture_text": "Then Jacob said unto his household, and to all that were with him, Put away the strange gods that are among you, and be clean, and change your garments:"
