        "book_title": "Genesis",
        "book_short_title": "Gen.",
        "chapter_number": 35,
        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "Genesis 35:4",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 35:4",
        "scripture_text": "And they gave unto Jacob all the strange gods which were in their hand, and all their earrings which were in their ears; and Jacob hid them under the oak which was by Shechem."
