        "verse_title": "Genesis 37:13",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 37:13",
        "scripture_text": "And Israel said unto Joseph, Do not thy brethren feed the flock in Shechem? come, and I will send thee unto them. And he said to him, Here am I."
