        "verse_title": "Genesis 37:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 37:14",
        "scripture_text": "And he said to him, Go, I pray thee, see whether it be well with thy brethren, and well with the flocks; and bring me word again. So he sent him out of the vale of Hebron, and he came to Shechem."
