        "book_title": "Genesis",
        "book_short_title": "Gen.",
        "chapter_number": 37,
        "verse_number": 18,
        "verse_title": "Genesis 37:18",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 37:18",
        "scripture_text": "And when they saw him afar off, even before he came near unto them, they conspired against him to slay him."
