        "verse_title": "Genesis 37:20",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 37:20",
        "scripture_text": "Come now therefore, and let us slay him, and cast him into some pit, and we will say, Some evil beast hath devoured him: and we shall see what will become of his dreams."
