        "verse_number": 28,
        "verse_title": "Genesis 37:28",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 37:28",
        "scripture_text": "Then there passed by Midianites merchantmen; and they drew and lifted up Joseph out of the pit, and sold Joseph to the Ishmeelites for twenty pieces of silver: and they brought Joseph into Egypt."
