        "book_short_title": "Gen.",
        "chapter_number": 37,
        "verse_number": 32,
        "verse_title": "Genesis 37:32",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 37:32",
        "scripture_text": "And they sent the coat of many colours, and they brought it to their father; and said, This have we found: know now whether it be thy son's coat or no."
