        "verse_title": "Genesis 38:9",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 38:9",
        "scripture_text": "And Onan knew that the seed should not be his; and it came to pass, when he went in unto his brother's wife, that he spilled it on the ground, lest that he should give seed to his brother."
