        "verse_title": "Genesis 38:24",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 38:24",
        "scripture_text": "And it came to pass about three months after, that it was told Judah, saying, Tamar thy daughter in law hath played the harlot; and also, behold, she is with child by whoredom. And Judah said, Bring her forth, and let her be burnt."
