        "verse_title": "Genesis 39:9",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 39:9",
        "scripture_text": "There is none greater in this house than I; neither hath he kept back any thing from me but thee, because thou art his wife: how then can I do this great wickedness, and sin against God?"
