        "chapter_number": 40,
        "verse_number": 16,
        "verse_title": "Genesis 40:16",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 40:16",
        "scripture_text": "When the chief baker saw that the interpretation was good, he said unto Joseph, I also was in my dream, and, behold, I had three white baskets on my head:"
