        "book_short_title": "Gen.",
        "chapter_number": 41,
        "verse_number": 12,
        "verse_title": "Genesis 41:12",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 41:12",
        "scripture_text": "And there was there with us a young man, an Hebrew, servant to the captain of the guard; and we told him, and he interpreted to us our dreams; to each man according to his dream he did interpret."
