        "verse_title": "Genesis 41:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 41:14",
        "scripture_text": "Then Pharaoh sent and called Joseph, and they brought him hastily out of the dungeon: and he shaved himself, and changed his raiment, and came in unto Pharaoh."
