        "verse_title": "Genesis 41:15",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 41:15",
        "scripture_text": "And Pharaoh said unto Joseph, I have dreamed a dream, and there is none that can interpret it: and I have heard say of thee, that thou canst understand a dream to interpret it."
