        "verse_title": "Genesis 44:31",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 44:31",
        "scripture_text": "It shall come to pass, when he seeth that the lad is not with us, that he will die: and thy servants shall bring down the gray hairs of thy servant our father with sorrow to the grave."
