        "verse_title": "Genesis 48:19",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 48:19",
        "scripture_text": "And his father refused, and said, I know it, my son, I know it: he also shall become a people, and he also shall be great: but truly his younger brother shall be greater than he, and his seed shall become a multitude of nations."
