        "book_short_title": "Gen.",
        "chapter_number": 49,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Genesis 49:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 49:6",
        "scripture_text": "O my soul, come not thou into their secret; unto their assembly, mine honour, be not thou united: for in their anger they slew a man, and in their selfwill they digged down a wall."
