        "verse_title": "Genesis 49:9",
        "verse_short_title": "Gen. 49:9",
        "scripture_text": "Judah is a lion's whelp: from the prey, my son, thou art gone up: he stooped down, he couched as a lion, and as an old lion; who shall rouse him up?"
