        "verse_title": "Exodus 12:3",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 12:3",
        "scripture_text": "Speak ye unto all the congregation of Israel, saying, In the tenth day of this month they shall take to them every man a lamb, according to the house of their fathers, a lamb for an house:"
