        "verse_title": "Exodus 12:4",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 12:4",
        "scripture_text": "And if the household be too little for the lamb, let him and his neighbour next unto his house take it according to the number of the souls; every man according to his eating shall make your count for the lamb."
