        "verse_title": "Exodus 12:12",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 12:12",
        "scripture_text": "For I will pass through the land of Egypt this night, and will smite all the firstborn in the land of Egypt, both man and beast; and against all the gods of Egypt I will execute judgment: I am the Lord."
