        "verse_title": "Exodus 12:13",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 12:13",
        "scripture_text": "And the blood shall be to you for a token upon the houses where ye are: and when I see the blood, I will pass over you, and the plague shall not be upon you to destroy you, when I smite the land of Egypt."
