        "verse_title": "Exodus 22:5",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 22:5",
        "scripture_text": "If a man shall cause a field or vineyard to be eaten, and shall put in his beast, and shall feed in another man's field; of the best of his own field, and of the best of his own vineyard, shall he make restitution."
