        "book_short_title": "Ex.",
        "chapter_number": 22,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Exodus 22:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 22:6",
        "scripture_text": "If fire break out, and catch in thorns, so that the stacks of corn, or the standing corn, or the field, be consumed therewith; he that kindled the fire shall surely make restitution."
