        "book_short_title": "Ex.",
        "chapter_number": 22,
        "verse_number": 8,
        "verse_title": "Exodus 22:8",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 22:8",
        "scripture_text": "If the thief be not found, then the master of the house shall be brought unto the judges, to see whether he have put his hand unto his neighbour's goods."
