        "verse_title": "Exodus 22:11",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 22:11",
        "scripture_text": "Then shall an oath of the Lord be between them both, that he hath not put his hand unto his neighbour's goods; and the owner of it shall accept thereof, and he shall not make it good."
