        "verse_title": "Exodus 29:2",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 29:2",
        "scripture_text": "And unleavened bread, and cakes unleavened tempered with oil, and wafers unleavened anointed with oil: of wheaten flour shalt thou make them."
