        "book_short_title": "Ex.",
        "chapter_number": 29,
        "verse_number": 5,
        "verse_title": "Exodus 29:5",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 29:5",
        "scripture_text": "And thou shalt take the garments, and put upon Aaron the coat, and the robe of the ephod, and the ephod, and the breastplate, and gird him with the curious girdle of the ephod:"
