        "book_title": "Exodus",
        "book_short_title": "Ex.",
        "chapter_number": 29,
        "verse_number": 9,
        "verse_title": "Exodus 29:9",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 29:9",
        "scripture_text": "And thou shalt gird them with girdles, Aaron and his sons, and put the bonnets on them: and the priest's office shall be theirs for a perpetual statute: and thou shalt consecrate Aaron and his sons."
