        "verse_title": "Exodus 29:10",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 29:10",
        "scripture_text": "And thou shalt cause a bullock to be brought before the tabernacle of the congregation: and Aaron and his sons shall put their hands upon the head of the bullock."
