        "verse_title": "Exodus 29:25",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 29:25",
        "scripture_text": "And thou shalt receive them of their hands, and burn them upon the altar for a burnt offering, for a sweet savour before the Lord: it is an offering made by fire unto the Lord."
