        "book_title": "Exodus",
        "book_short_title": "Ex.",
        "chapter_number": 29,
        "verse_number": 28,
        "verse_title": "Exodus 29:28",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 29:28",
        "scripture_text": "And it shall be Aaron's and his sons' by a statute for ever from the children of Israel: for it is an heave offering: and it shall be an heave offering from the children of Israel of the sacrifice of their peace offerings, even their heave offering unto the Lord."
