        "verse_number": 32,
        "verse_title": "Exodus 29:32",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 29:32",
        "scripture_text": "And Aaron and his sons shall eat the flesh of the ram, and the bread that is in the basket, by the door of the tabernacle of the congregation."
