        "verse_title": "Exodus 29:36",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 29:36",
        "scripture_text": "And thou shalt offer every day a bullock for a sin offering for atonement: and thou shalt cleanse the altar, when thou hast made an atonement for it, and thou shalt anoint it, to sanctify it."
