        "book_short_title": "Ex.",
        "chapter_number": 29,
        "verse_number": 41,
        "verse_title": "Exodus 29:41",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 29:41",
        "scripture_text": "And the other lamb thou shalt offer at even, and shalt do thereto according to the meat offering of the morning, and according to the drink offering thereof, for a sweet savour, an offering made by fire unto the Lord."
