        "verse_title": "Exodus 29:44",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 29:44",
        "scripture_text": "And I will sanctify the tabernacle of the congregation, and the altar: I will sanctify also both Aaron and his sons, to minister to me in the priest's office."
