        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "Exodus",
        "book_short_title": "Ex.",
        "chapter_number": 30,
        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "Exodus 30:4",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 30:4",
        "scripture_text": "And two golden rings shalt thou make to it under the crown of it, by the two corners thereof, upon the two sides of it shalt thou make it; and they shall be for places for the staves to bear it withal."
