        "verse_title": "Exodus 36:11",
        "verse_short_title": "Ex. 36:11",
        "scripture_text": "And he made loops of blue on the edge of one curtain from the selvedge in the coupling: likewise he made in the uttermost side of another curtain, in the coupling of the second."
