        "book_title": "Leviticus",
        "book_short_title": "Lev.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 9,
        "verse_title": "Leviticus 5:9",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 5:9",
        "scripture_text": "And he shall sprinkle of the blood of the sin offering upon the side of the altar; and the rest of the blood shall be wrung out at the bottom of the altar: it is a sin offering."
