        "book_short_title": "Lev.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 10,
        "verse_title": "Leviticus 5:10",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 5:10",
        "scripture_text": "And he shall offer the second for a burnt offering, according to the manner: and the priest shall make an atonement for him for his sin which he hath sinned, and it shall be forgiven him."
