        "verse_title": "Leviticus 9:23",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 9:23",
        "scripture_text": "And Moses and Aaron went into the tabernacle of the congregation, and came out, and blessed the people: and the glory of the Lord appeared unto all the people."
