        "verse_title": "Leviticus 9:24",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 9:24",
        "scripture_text": "And there came a fire out from before the Lord, and consumed upon the altar the burnt offering and the fat: which when all the people saw, they shouted, and fell on their faces."
