        "book_title": "Leviticus",
        "book_short_title": "Lev.",
        "chapter_number": 10,
        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "Leviticus 10:3",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 10:3",
        "scripture_text": "Then Moses said unto Aaron, This is it that the Lord spake, saying, I will be sanctified in them that come nigh me, and before all the people I will be glorified. And Aaron held his peace."
