        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Leviticus 10:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 10:6",
        "scripture_text": "And Moses said unto Aaron, and unto Eleazar and unto Ithamar, his sons, Uncover not your heads, neither rend your clothes; lest ye die, and lest wrath come upon all the people: but let your brethren, the whole house of Israel, bewail the burning which the Lord hath kindled."
