        "verse_number": 26,
        "verse_title": "Leviticus 11:26",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 11:26",
        "scripture_text": "The carcases of every beast which divideth the hoof, and is not clovenfooted, nor cheweth the cud, are unclean unto you: every one that toucheth them shall be unclean."
