        "verse_title": "Leviticus 15:3",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 15:3",
        "scripture_text": "And this shall be his uncleanness in his issue: whether his flesh run with his issue, or his flesh be stopped from his issue, it is his uncleanness."
