        "verse_title": "Leviticus 15:26",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 15:26",
        "scripture_text": "Every bed whereon she lieth all the days of her issue shall be unto her as the bed of her separation: and whatsoever she sitteth upon shall be unclean, as the uncleanness of her separation."
