        "verse_number": 14,
        "verse_title": "Leviticus 16:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 16:14",
        "scripture_text": "And he shall take of the blood of the bullock, and sprinkle it with his finger upon the mercy seat eastward; and before the mercy seat shall he sprinkle of the blood with his finger seven times."
