        "verse_title": "Leviticus 16:18",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 16:18",
        "scripture_text": "And he shall go out unto the altar that is before the Lord, and make an atonement for it; and shall take of the blood of the bullock, and of the blood of the goat, and put it upon the horns of the altar round about."
