        "verse_title": "Leviticus 16:19",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 16:19",
        "scripture_text": "And he shall sprinkle of the blood upon it with his finger seven times, and cleanse it, and hallow it from the uncleanness of the children of Israel."
