        "book_short_title": "Lev.",
        "chapter_number": 21,
        "verse_number": 18,
        "verse_title": "Leviticus 21:18",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 21:18",
        "scripture_text": "For whatsoever man he be that hath a blemish, he shall not approach: a blind man, or a lame, or he that hath a flat nose, or any thing superfluous,"
