        "book_title": "Leviticus",
        "book_short_title": "Lev.",
        "chapter_number": 21,
        "verse_number": 21,
        "verse_title": "Leviticus 21:21",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 21:21",
        "scripture_text": "No man that hath a blemish of the seed of Aaron the priest shall come nigh to offer the offerings of the Lord made by fire: he hath a blemish; he shall not come nigh to offer the bread of his God."
