        "verse_title": "Leviticus 21:23",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 21:23",
        "scripture_text": "Only he shall not go in unto the veil, nor come nigh unto the altar, because he hath a blemish; that he profane not my sanctuaries: for I the Lord do sanctify them."
