        "verse_number": 11,
        "verse_title": "Leviticus 23:11",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 23:11",
        "scripture_text": "And he shall wave the sheaf before the Lord, to be accepted for you: on the morrow after the sabbath the priest shall wave it."
