        "book_title": "Leviticus",
        "book_short_title": "Lev.",
        "chapter_number": 23,
        "verse_number": 13,
        "verse_title": "Leviticus 23:13",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 23:13",
        "scripture_text": "And the meat offering thereof shall be two tenth deals of fine flour mingled with oil, an offering made by fire unto the Lord for a sweet savour: and the drink offering thereof shall be of wine, the fourth part of an hin."
