        "verse_title": "Leviticus 23:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Lev. 23:14",
        "scripture_text": "And ye shall eat neither bread, nor parched corn, nor green ears, until the selfsame day that ye have brought an offering unto your God: it shall be a statute for ever throughout your generations in all your dwellings."
