        "verse_title": "Numbers 3:43",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 3:43",
        "scripture_text": "And all the firstborn males by the number of names, from a month old and upward, of those that were numbered of them, were twenty and two thousand two hundred and threescore and thirteen."
