        "verse_title": "Numbers 3:47",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 3:47",
        "scripture_text": "Thou shalt even take five shekels apiece by the poll, after the shekel of the sanctuary shalt thou take them: (the shekel is twenty gerahs:)"
