        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 4,
        "verse_number": 7,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 4:7",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 4:7",
        "scripture_text": "And upon the table of shewbread they shall spread a cloth of blue, and put thereon the dishes, and the spoons, and the bowls, and covers to cover withal: and the continual bread shall be thereon:"
