        "chapter_number": 4,
        "verse_number": 8,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 4:8",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 4:8",
        "scripture_text": "And they shall spread upon them a cloth of scarlet, and cover the same with a covering of badgers' skins, and shall put in the staves thereof."
