        "verse_number": 7,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 5:7",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 5:7",
        "scripture_text": "Then they shall confess their sin which they have done: and he shall recompense his trespass with the principal thereof, and add unto it the fifth part thereof, and give it unto him against whom he hath trespassed."
