        "verse_number": 14,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 5:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 5:14",
        "scripture_text": "And the spirit of jealousy come upon him, and he be jealous of his wife, and she be defiled: or if the spirit of jealousy come upon him, and he be jealous of his wife, and she be not defiled:"
