        "verse_number": 20,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 5:20",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 5:20",
        "scripture_text": "But if thou hast gone aside to another instead of thy husband, and if thou be defiled, and some man have lain with thee beside thine husband:"
