        "verse_number": 20,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 6:20",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 6:20",
        "scripture_text": "And the priest shall wave them for a wave offering before the Lord: this is holy for the priest, with the wave breast and heave shoulder: and after that the Nazarite may drink wine."
