        "verse_number": 15,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 8:15",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 8:15",
        "scripture_text": "And after that shall the Levites go in to do the service of the tabernacle of the congregation: and thou shalt cleanse them, and offer them for an offering."
