        "book_title": "Numbers",
        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 8,
        "verse_number": 17,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 8:17",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 8:17",
        "scripture_text": "For all the firstborn of the children of Israel are mine, both man and beast: on the day that I smote every firstborn in the land of Egypt I sanctified them for myself."
