        "book_title": "Numbers",
        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 8,
        "verse_number": 21,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 8:21",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 8:21",
        "scripture_text": "And the Levites were purified, and they washed their clothes; and Aaron offered them as an offering before the Lord; and Aaron made an atonement for them to cleanse them."
