        "book_title": "Numbers",
        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 8,
        "verse_number": 22,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 8:22",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 8:22",
        "scripture_text": "And after that went the Levites in to do their service in the tabernacle of the congregation before Aaron, and before his sons: as the Lord had commanded Moses concerning the Levites, so did they unto them."
