        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 9,
        "verse_number": 21,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 9:21",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 9:21",
        "scripture_text": "And so it was, when the cloud abode from even unto the morning, and that the cloud was taken up in the morning, then they journeyed: whether it was by day or by night that the cloud was taken up, they journeyed."
