        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 10,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 10:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 10:6",
        "scripture_text": "When ye blow an alarm the second time, then the camps that lie on the south side shall take their journey: they shall blow an alarm for their journeys."
