        "book_title": "Numbers",
        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 10,
        "verse_number": 33,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 10:33",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 10:33",
        "scripture_text": "And they departed from the mount of the Lord three days' journey: and the ark of the covenant of the Lord went before them in the three days' journey, to search out a resting place for them."
