        "verse_number": 8,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 11:8",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 11:8",
        "scripture_text": "And the people went about, and gathered it, and ground it in mills, or beat it in a mortar, and baked it in pans, and made cakes of it: and the taste of it was as the taste of fresh oil."
