        "verse_title": "Numbers 14:22",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 14:22",
        "scripture_text": "Because all those men which have seen my glory, and my miracles, which I did in Egypt and in the wilderness, and have tempted me now these ten times, and have not hearkened to my voice;"
