        "verse_title": "Numbers 14:24",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 14:24",
        "scripture_text": "But my servant Caleb, because he had another spirit with him, and hath followed me fully, him will I bring into the land whereinto he went; and his seed shall possess it."
