        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 14,
        "verse_number": 25,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 14:25",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 14:25",
        "scripture_text": "(Now the Amalekites and the Canaanites dwelt in the valley.) To morrow turn you, and get you into the wilderness by the way of the Red sea."
