        "chapter_number": 14,
        "verse_number": 27,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 14:27",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 14:27",
        "scripture_text": "How long shall I bear with this evil congregation, which murmur against me? I have heard the murmurings of the children of Israel, which they murmur against me."
