        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 14,
        "verse_number": 28,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 14:28",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 14:28",
        "scripture_text": "Say unto them, As truly as I live, saith the Lord, as ye have spoken in mine ears, so will I do to you:"
