        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 14,
        "verse_number": 29,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 14:29",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 14:29",
        "scripture_text": "Your carcases shall fall in this wilderness; and all that were numbered of you, according to your whole number, from twenty years old and upward, which have murmured against me,"
