        "chapter_number": 14,
        "verse_number": 31,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 14:31",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 14:31",
        "scripture_text": "But your little ones, which ye said should be a prey, them will I bring in, and they shall know the land which ye have despised."
