        "book_title": "Numbers",
        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 14,
        "verse_number": 36,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 14:36",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 14:36",
        "scripture_text": "And the men, which Moses sent to search the land, who returned, and made all the congregation to murmur against him, by bringing up a slander upon the land,"
