        "verse_title": "Numbers 14:43",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 14:43",
        "scripture_text": "For the Amalekites and the Canaanites are there before you, and ye shall fall by the sword: because ye are turned away from the Lord, therefore the Lord will not be with you."
