        "verse_number": 44,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 14:44",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 14:44",
        "scripture_text": "But they presumed to go up unto the hill top: nevertheless the ark of the covenant of the Lord, and Moses, departed not out of the camp."
