        "book_title": "Numbers",
        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 15,
        "verse_number": 8,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 15:8",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 15:8",
        "scripture_text": "And when thou preparest a bullock for a burnt offering, or for a sacrifice in performing a vow, or peace offerings unto the Lord:"
