        "verse_title": "Numbers 15:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 15:14",
        "scripture_text": "And if a stranger sojourn with you, or whosoever be among you in your generations, and will offer an offering made by fire, of a sweet savour unto the Lord; as ye do, so he shall do."
