        "chapter_number": 15,
        "verse_number": 15,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 15:15",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 15:15",
        "scripture_text": "One ordinance shall be both for you of the congregation, and also for the stranger that sojourneth with you, an ordinance for ever in your generations: as ye are, so shall the stranger be before the Lord."
