        "verse_title": "Numbers 17:5",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 17:5",
        "scripture_text": "And it shall come to pass, that the man's rod, whom I shall choose, shall blossom: and I will make to cease from me the murmurings of the children of Israel, whereby they murmur against you."
