        "chapter_number": 17,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 17:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 17:6",
        "scripture_text": "And Moses spake unto the children of Israel, and every one of their princes gave him a rod apiece, for each prince one, according to their fathers' houses, even twelve rods: and the rod of Aaron was among their rods."
