        "verse_title": "Numbers 17:8",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 17:8",
        "scripture_text": "And it came to pass, that on the morrow Moses went into the tabernacle of witness; and, behold, the rod of Aaron for the house of Levi was budded, and brought forth buds, and bloomed blossoms, and yielded almonds."
