        "verse_title": "Numbers 17:10",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 17:10",
        "scripture_text": "And the Lord said unto Moses, Bring Aaron's rod again before the testimony, to be kept for a token against the rebels; and thou shalt quite take away their murmurings from me, that they die not."
