        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "Numbers",
        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 18,
        "verse_number": 11,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 18:11",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 18:11",
        "scripture_text": "And this is thine; the heave offering of their gift, with all the wave offerings of the children of Israel: I have given them unto thee, and to thy sons and to thy daughters with thee, by a statute for ever: every one that is clean in thy house shall eat of it."
