        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "Numbers",
        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 18,
        "verse_number": 17,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 18:17",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 18:17",
        "scripture_text": "But the firstling of a cow, or the firstling of a sheep, or the firstling of a goat, thou shalt not redeem; they are holy: thou shalt sprinkle their blood upon the altar, and shalt burn their fat for an offering made by fire, for a sweet savour unto the Lord."
