        "book_title": "Numbers",
        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 18,
        "verse_number": 23,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 18:23",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 18:23",
        "scripture_text": "But the Levites shall do the service of the tabernacle of the congregation, and they shall bear their iniquity: it shall be a statute for ever throughout your generations, that among the children of Israel they have no inheritance."
