        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 18,
        "verse_number": 24,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 18:24",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 18:24",
        "scripture_text": "But the tithes of the children of Israel, which they offer as an heave offering unto the Lord, I have given to the Levites to inherit: therefore I have said unto them, Among the children of Israel they shall have no inheritance."
