        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 19:2",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 19:2",
        "scripture_text": "This is the ordinance of the law which the Lord hath commanded, saying, Speak unto the children of Israel, that they bring thee a red heifer without spot, wherein is no blemish, and upon which never came yoke:"
