        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 19,
        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 19:3",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 19:3",
        "scripture_text": "And ye shall give her unto Eleazar the priest, that he may bring her forth without the camp, and one shall slay her before his face:"
