        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "Numbers",
        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 19,
        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 19:4",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 19:4",
        "scripture_text": "And Eleazar the priest shall take of her blood with his finger, and sprinkle of her blood directly before the tabernacle of the congregation seven times:"
