        "book_title": "Numbers",
        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 19,
        "verse_number": 5,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 19:5",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 19:5",
        "scripture_text": "And one shall burn the heifer in his sight; her skin, and her flesh, and her blood, with her dung, shall he burn:"
