        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 19,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 19:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 19:6",
        "scripture_text": "And the priest shall take cedar wood, and hyssop, and scarlet, and cast it into the midst of the burning of the heifer."
