        "verse_title": "Numbers 19:16",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 19:16",
        "scripture_text": "And whosoever toucheth one that is slain with a sword in the open fields, or a dead body, or a bone of a man, or a grave, shall be unclean seven days."
