        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 19,
        "verse_number": 17,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 19:17",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 19:17",
        "scripture_text": "And for an unclean person they shall take of the ashes of the burnt heifer of purification for sin, and running water shall be put thereto in a vessel:"
