        "verse_number": 19,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 19:19",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 19:19",
        "scripture_text": "And the clean person shall sprinkle upon the unclean on the third day, and on the seventh day: and on the seventh day he shall purify himself, and wash his clothes, and bathe himself in water, and shall be clean at even."
