        "chapter_number": 20,
        "verse_number": 8,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 20:8",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 20:8",
        "scripture_text": "Take the rod, and gather thou the assembly together, thou, and Aaron thy brother, and speak ye unto the rock before their eyes; and it shall give forth his water, and thou shalt bring forth to them water out of the rock: so thou shalt give the congregation and their beasts drink."
