        "verse_title": "Numbers 20:10",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 20:10",
        "scripture_text": "And Moses and Aaron gathered the congregation together before the rock, and he said unto them, Hear now, ye rebels; must we fetch you water out of this rock?"
