        "verse_title": "Numbers 20:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 20:14",
        "scripture_text": "And Moses sent messengers from Kadesh unto the king of Edom, Thus saith thy brother Israel, Thou knowest all the travail that hath befallen us:"
