        "book_title": "Numbers",
        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 20,
        "verse_number": 17,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 20:17",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 20:17",
        "scripture_text": "Let us pass, I pray thee, through thy country: we will not pass through the fields, or through the vineyards, neither will we drink of the water of the wells: we will go by the king's high way, we will not turn to the right hand nor to the left, until we have passed thy borders."
