        "book_title": "Numbers",
        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 20,
        "verse_number": 21,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 20:21",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 20:21",
        "scripture_text": "Thus Edom refused to give Israel passage through his border: wherefore Israel turned away from him."
