        "verse_number": 7,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 21:7",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 21:7",
        "scripture_text": "Therefore the people came to Moses, and said, We have sinned, for we have spoken against the Lord, and against thee; pray unto the Lord, that he take away the serpents from us. And Moses prayed for the people."
