        "book_title": "Numbers",
        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 21,
        "verse_number": 8,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 21:8",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 21:8",
        "scripture_text": "And the Lord said unto Moses, Make thee a fiery serpent, and set it upon a pole: and it shall come to pass, that every one that is bitten, when he looketh upon it, shall live."
