        "chapter_number": 21,
        "verse_number": 9,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 21:9",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 21:9",
        "scripture_text": "And Moses made a serpent of brass, and put it upon a pole, and it came to pass, that if a serpent had bitten any man, when he beheld the serpent of brass, he lived."
