        "verse_title": "Numbers 25:11",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 25:11",
        "scripture_text": "Phinehas, the son of Eleazar, the son of Aaron the priest, hath turned my wrath away from the children of Israel, while he was zealous for my sake among them, that I consumed not the children of Israel in my jealousy."
