        "book_title": "Numbers",
        "book_short_title": "Num.",
        "chapter_number": 31,
        "verse_number": 14,
        "verse_title": "Numbers 31:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 31:14",
        "scripture_text": "And Moses was wroth with the officers of the host, with the captains over thousands, and captains over hundreds, which came from the battle."
