        "verse_title": "Numbers 31:28",
        "verse_short_title": "Num. 31:28",
        "scripture_text": "And levy a tribute unto the Lord of the men of war which went out to battle: one soul of five hundred, both of the persons, and of the beeves, and of the asses, and of the sheep:"
