        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 5:24",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 5:24",
        "scripture_text": "And ye said, Behold, the Lord our God hath shewed us his glory and his greatness, and we have heard his voice out of the midst of the fire: we have seen this day that God doth talk with man, and he liveth."
