        "book_title": "Deuteronomy",
        "book_short_title": "Deut.",
        "chapter_number": 11,
        "verse_number": 24,
        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 11:24",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 11:24",
        "scripture_text": "Every place whereon the soles of your feet shall tread shall be yours: from the wilderness and Lebanon, from the river, the river Euphrates, even unto the uttermost sea shall your coast be."
