        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 11:28",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 11:28",
        "scripture_text": "And a curse, if ye will not obey the commandments of the Lord your God, but turn aside out of the way which I command you this day, to go after other gods, which ye have not known."
