        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 12:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 12:14",
        "scripture_text": "But in the place which the Lord shall choose in one of thy tribes, there thou shalt offer thy burnt offerings, and there thou shalt do all that I command thee."
