        "book_title": "Deuteronomy",
        "book_short_title": "Deut.",
        "chapter_number": 12,
        "verse_number": 15,
        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 12:15",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 12:15",
        "scripture_text": "Notwithstanding thou mayest kill and eat flesh in all thy gates, whatsoever thy soul lusteth after, according to the blessing of the Lord thy God which he hath given thee: the unclean and the clean may eat thereof, as of the roebuck, and as of the hart."
