        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "Deuteronomy",
        "book_short_title": "Deut.",
        "chapter_number": 17,
        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 17:4",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 17:4",
        "scripture_text": "And it be told thee, and thou hast heard of it, and inquired diligently, and, behold, it be true, and the thing certain, that such abomination is wrought in Israel:"
