        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 17:10",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 17:10",
        "scripture_text": "And thou shalt do according to the sentence, which they of that place which the Lord shall choose shall shew thee; and thou shalt observe to do according to all that they inform thee:"
