        "book_title": "Deuteronomy",
        "book_short_title": "Deut.",
        "chapter_number": 17,
        "verse_number": 14,
        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 17:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 17:14",
        "scripture_text": "When thou art come unto the land which the Lord thy God giveth thee, and shalt possess it, and shalt dwell therein, and shalt say, I will set a king over me, like as all the nations that are about me;"
