        "chapter_number": 17,
        "verse_number": 15,
        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 17:15",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 17:15",
        "scripture_text": "Thou shalt in any wise set him king over thee, whom the Lord thy God shall choose: one from among thy brethren shalt thou set king over thee: thou mayest not set a stranger over thee, which is not thy brother."
