        "book_title": "Deuteronomy",
        "book_short_title": "Deut.",
        "chapter_number": 17,
        "verse_number": 16,
        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 17:16",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 17:16",
        "scripture_text": "But he shall not multiply horses to himself, nor cause the people to return to Egypt, to the end that he should multiply horses: forasmuch as the Lord hath said unto you, Ye shall henceforth return no more that way."
