        "verse_number": 19,
        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 17:19",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 17:19",
        "scripture_text": "And it shall be with him, and he shall read therein all the days of his life: that he may learn to fear the Lord his God, to keep all the words of this law and these statutes, to do them:"
