        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 17:20",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 17:20",
        "scripture_text": "That his heart be not lifted up above his brethren, and that he turn not aside from the commandment, to the right hand, or to the left: to the end that he may prolong his days in his kingdom, he, and his children, in the midst of Israel."
