        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 19:3",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 19:3",
        "scripture_text": "Thou shalt prepare thee a way, and divide the coasts of thy land, which the Lord thy God giveth thee to inherit, into three parts, that every slayer may flee thither."
