        "chapter_number": 19,
        "verse_number": 5,
        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 19:5",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 19:5",
        "scripture_text": "As when a man goeth into the wood with his neighbour to hew wood, and his hand fetcheth a stroke with the axe to cut down the tree, and the head slippeth from the helve, and lighteth upon his neighbour, that he die; he shall flee unto one of those cities, and live:"
