        "book_title": "Deuteronomy",
        "book_short_title": "Deut.",
        "chapter_number": 20,
        "verse_number": 1,
        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 20:1",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 20:1",
        "scripture_text": "When thou goest out to battle against thine enemies, and seest horses, and chariots, and a people more than thou, be not afraid of them: for the Lord thy God is with thee, which brought thee up out of the land of Egypt."
