        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 20:3",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 20:3",
        "scripture_text": "And shall say unto them, Hear, O Israel, ye approach this day unto battle against your enemies: let not your hearts faint, fear not, and do not tremble, neither be ye terrified because of them;"
