        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 20:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 20:6",
        "scripture_text": "And what man is he that hath planted a vineyard, and hath not yet eaten of it? let him also go and return unto his house, lest he die in the battle, and another man eat of it."
