        "book_short_title": "Deut.",
        "chapter_number": 20,
        "verse_number": 19,
        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 20:19",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 20:19",
        "scripture_text": "When thou shalt besiege a city a long time, in making war against it to take it, thou shalt not destroy the trees thereof by forcing an axe against them: for thou mayest eat of them, and thou shalt not cut them down (for the tree of the field is man's life) to employ them in the siege:"
