        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 21:8",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 21:8",
        "scripture_text": "Be merciful, O Lord, unto thy people Israel, whom thou hast redeemed, and lay not innocent blood unto thy people of Israel's charge. And the blood shall be forgiven them."
