        "book_title": "Deuteronomy",
        "book_short_title": "Deut.",
        "chapter_number": 22,
        "verse_number": 19,
        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 22:19",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 22:19",
        "scripture_text": "And they shall amerce him in an hundred shekels of silver, and give them unto the father of the damsel, because he hath brought up an evil name upon a virgin of Israel: and she shall be his wife; he may not put her away all his days."
