        "book_title": "Deuteronomy",
        "book_short_title": "Deut.",
        "chapter_number": 22,
        "verse_number": 29,
        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 22:29",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 22:29",
        "scripture_text": "Then the man that lay with her shall give unto the damsel's father fifty shekels of silver, and she shall be his wife; because he hath humbled her, he may not put her away all his days."
