        "book_title": "Deuteronomy",
        "book_short_title": "Deut.",
        "chapter_number": 25,
        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 25:3",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 25:3",
        "scripture_text": "Forty stripes he may give him, and not exceed: lest, if he should exceed, and beat him above these with many stripes, then thy brother should seem vile unto thee."
