        "book_title": "Deuteronomy",
        "book_short_title": "Deut.",
        "chapter_number": 29,
        "verse_number": 26,
        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 29:26",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 29:26",
        "scripture_text": "For they went and served other gods, and worshipped them, gods whom they knew not, and whom he had not given unto them:"
