        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "Deuteronomy",
        "book_short_title": "Deut.",
        "chapter_number": 29,
        "verse_number": 27,
        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 29:27",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 29:27",
        "scripture_text": "And the anger of the Lord was kindled against this land, to bring upon it all the curses that are written in this book:"
