        "book_title": "Deuteronomy",
        "book_short_title": "Deut.",
        "chapter_number": 29,
        "verse_number": 28,
        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 29:28",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 29:28",
        "scripture_text": "And the Lord rooted them out of their land in anger, and in wrath, and in great indignation, and cast them into another land, as it is this day."
