        "book_title": "Deuteronomy",
        "book_short_title": "Deut.",
        "chapter_number": 34,
        "verse_number": 11,
        "verse_title": "Deuteronomy 34:11",
        "verse_short_title": "Deut. 34:11",
        "scripture_text": "In all the signs and the wonders, which the Lord sent him to do in the land of Egypt to Pharaoh, and to all his servants, and to all his land,"
