        "verse_number": 19,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 2:19",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 2:19",
        "scripture_text": "And it shall be, that whosoever shall go out of the doors of thy house into the street, his blood shall be upon his head, and we will be guiltless: and whosoever shall be with thee in the house, his blood shall be on our head, if any hand be upon him."
