        "chapter_number": 4,
        "verse_number": 1,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 4:1",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 4:1",
        "scripture_text": "And it came to pass, when all the people were clean passed over Jordan, that the Lord spake unto Joshua, saying,"
