        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "Joshua",
        "book_short_title": "Josh.",
        "chapter_number": 4,
        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 4:4",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 4:4",
        "scripture_text": "Then Joshua called the twelve men, whom he had prepared of the children of Israel, out of every tribe a man:"
