        "book_short_title": "Josh.",
        "chapter_number": 4,
        "verse_number": 14,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 4:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 4:14",
        "scripture_text": "On that day the Lord magnified Joshua in the sight of all Israel; and they feared him, as they feared Moses, all the days of his life."
