        "book_title": "Joshua",
        "book_short_title": "Josh.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 5:2",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 5:2",
        "scripture_text": "At that time the Lord said unto Joshua, Make thee sharp knives, and circumcise again the children of Israel the second time."
