        "book_title": "Joshua",
        "book_short_title": "Josh.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 11,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 5:11",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 5:11",
        "scripture_text": "And they did eat of the old corn of the land on the morrow after the passover, unleavened cakes, and parched corn in the selfsame day."
