        "verse_title": "Joshua 5:12",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 5:12",
        "scripture_text": "And the manna ceased on the morrow after they had eaten of the old corn of the land; neither had the children of Israel manna any more; but they did eat of the fruit of the land of Canaan that year."
