        "book_title": "Joshua",
        "book_short_title": "Josh.",
        "chapter_number": 6,
        "verse_number": 20,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 6:20",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 6:20",
        "scripture_text": "So the people shouted when the priests blew with the trumpets: and it came to pass, when the people heard the sound of the trumpet, and the people shouted with a great shout, that the wall fell down flat, so that the people went up into the city, every man straight before him, and they took the city."
