        "book_short_title": "Josh.",
        "chapter_number": 9,
        "verse_number": 15,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 9:15",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 9:15",
        "scripture_text": "And Joshua made peace with them, and made a league with them, to let them live: and the princes of the congregation sware unto them."
