        "book_title": "Joshua",
        "book_short_title": "Josh.",
        "chapter_number": 9,
        "verse_number": 17,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 9:17",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 9:17",
        "scripture_text": "And the children of Israel journeyed, and came unto their cities on the third day. Now their cities were Gibeon, and Chephirah, and Beeroth, and Kirjath-jearim."
