        "verse_title": "Joshua 9:22",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 9:22",
        "scripture_text": "And Joshua called for them, and he spake unto them, saying, Wherefore have ye beguiled us, saying, We are very far from you; when ye dwell among us?"
