        "verse_number": 23,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 9:23",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 9:23",
        "scripture_text": "Now therefore ye are cursed, and there shall none of you be freed from being bondmen, and hewers of wood and drawers of water for the house of my God."
