        "book_title": "Joshua",
        "book_short_title": "Josh.",
        "chapter_number": 9,
        "verse_number": 26,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 9:26",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 9:26",
        "scripture_text": "And so did he unto them, and delivered them out of the hand of the children of Israel, that they slew them not."
