        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "Joshua",
        "book_short_title": "Josh.",
        "chapter_number": 10,
        "verse_number": 19,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 10:19",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 10:19",
        "scripture_text": "And stay ye not, but pursue after your enemies, and smite the hindmost of them; suffer them not to enter into their cities: for the Lord your God hath delivered them into your hand."
