        "book_title": "Joshua",
        "book_short_title": "Josh.",
        "chapter_number": 10,
        "verse_number": 35,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 10:35",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 10:35",
        "scripture_text": "And they took it on that day, and smote it with the edge of the sword, and all the souls that were therein he utterly destroyed that day, according to all that he had done to Lachish."
