        "book_short_title": "Josh.",
        "chapter_number": 10,
        "verse_number": 37,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 10:37",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 10:37",
        "scripture_text": "And they took it, and smote it with the edge of the sword, and the king thereof, and all the cities thereof, and all the souls that were therein; he left none remaining, according to all that he had done to Eglon; but destroyed it utterly, and all the souls that were therein."
