        "verse_title": "Joshua 17:7",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 17:7",
        "scripture_text": "And the coast of Manasseh was from Asher to Michmethah, that lieth before Shechem; and the border went along on the right hand unto the inhabitants of En-tappuah."
