        "verse_title": "Joshua 17:9",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 17:9",
        "scripture_text": "And the coast descended unto the river Kanah, southward of the river: these cities of Ephraim are among the cities of Manasseh: the coast of Manasseh also was on the north side of the river, and the outgoings of it were at the sea:"
