        "book_title": "Joshua",
        "book_short_title": "Josh.",
        "chapter_number": 17,
        "verse_number": 12,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 17:12",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 17:12",
        "scripture_text": "Yet the children of Manasseh could not drive out the inhabitants of those cities; but the Canaanites would dwell in that land."
