        "verse_number": 14,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 17:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 17:14",
        "scripture_text": "And the children of Joseph spake unto Joshua, saying, Why hast thou given me but one lot and one portion to inherit, seeing I am a great people, forasmuch as the Lord hath blessed me hitherto?"
