        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "Joshua",
        "book_short_title": "Josh.",
        "chapter_number": 17,
        "verse_number": 16,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 17:16",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 17:16",
        "scripture_text": "And the children of Joseph said, The hill is not enough for us: and all the Canaanites that dwell in the land of the valley have chariots of iron, both they who are of Beth-shean and her towns, and they who are of the valley of Jezreel."
