        "verse_title": "Joshua 17:17",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 17:17",
        "scripture_text": "And Joshua spake unto the house of Joseph, even to Ephraim and to Manasseh, saying, Thou art a great people, and hast great power: thou shalt not have one lot only:"
