        "chapter_number": 18,
        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 18:3",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 18:3",
        "scripture_text": "And Joshua said unto the children of Israel, How long are ye slack to go to possess the land, which the Lord God of your fathers hath given you?"
