        "book_title": "Joshua",
        "book_short_title": "Josh.",
        "chapter_number": 18,
        "verse_number": 7,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 18:7",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 18:7",
        "scripture_text": "But the Levites have no part among you; for the priesthood of the Lord is their inheritance: and Gad, and Reuben, and half the tribe of Manasseh, have received their inheritance beyond Jordan on the east, which Moses the servant of the Lord gave them."
