        "verse_title": "Joshua 18:8",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 18:8",
        "scripture_text": "And the men arose, and went away: and Joshua charged them that went to describe the land, saying, Go and walk through the land, and describe it, and come again to me, that I may here cast lots for you before the Lord in Shiloh."
