        "verse_number": 21,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 21:21",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 21:21",
        "scripture_text": "For they gave them Shechem with her suburbs in mount Ephraim, to be a city of refuge for the slayer; and Gezer with her suburbs,"
