        "chapter_number": 21,
        "verse_number": 27,
        "verse_title": "Joshua 21:27",
        "verse_short_title": "Josh. 21:27",
        "scripture_text": "And unto the children of Gershon, of the families of the Levites, out of the other half tribe of Manasseh they gave Golan in Bashan with her suburbs, to be a city of refuge for the slayer; and Beesh-terah with her suburbs; two cities."
