        "book_title": "Judges",
        "book_short_title": "Judg.",
        "chapter_number": 8,
        "verse_number": 18,
        "verse_title": "Judges 8:18",
        "verse_short_title": "Judg. 8:18",
        "scripture_text": "Then said he unto Zebah and Zalmunna, What manner of men were they whom ye slew at Tabor? And they answered, As thou art, so were they; each one resembled the children of a king."
