        "book_title": "Judges",
        "book_short_title": "Judg.",
        "chapter_number": 8,
        "verse_number": 19,
        "verse_title": "Judges 8:19",
        "verse_short_title": "Judg. 8:19",
        "scripture_text": "And he said, They were my brethren, even the sons of my mother: as the Lord liveth, if ye had saved them alive, I would not slay you."
