        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 3:3",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 3:3",
        "scripture_text": "And ere the lamp of God went out in the temple of the Lord, where the ark of God was, and Samuel was laid down to sleep;"
