        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 3:6",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 3:6",
        "scripture_text": "And the Lord called yet again, Samuel. And Samuel arose and went to Eli, and said, Here am I; for thou didst call me. And he answered, I called not, my son; lie down again."
