        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 3:10",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 3:10",
        "scripture_text": "And the Lord came, and stood, and called as at other times, Samuel, Samuel. Then Samuel answered, Speak; for thy servant heareth."
