        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 3:14",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 3:14",
        "scripture_text": "And therefore I have sworn unto the house of Eli, that the iniquity of Eli's house shall not be purged with sacrifice nor offering for ever."
