        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 3:17",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 3:17",
        "scripture_text": "And he said, What is the thing that the Lord hath said unto thee? I pray thee hide it not from me: God do so to thee, and more also, if thou hide any thing from me of all the things that he said unto thee."
