        "book_title": "1 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "1 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 4,
        "verse_number": 7,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 4:7",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 4:7",
        "scripture_text": "And the Philistines were afraid, for they said, God is come into the camp. And they said, Woe unto us! for there hath not been such a thing heretofore."
