        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 4:9",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 4:9",
        "scripture_text": "Be strong, and quit yourselves like men, O ye Philistines, that ye be not servants unto the Hebrews, as they have been to you: quit yourselves like men, and fight."
