        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 4:10",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 4:10",
        "scripture_text": "And the Philistines fought, and Israel was smitten, and they fled every man into his tent: and there was a very great slaughter; for there fell of Israel thirty thousand footmen."
