        "book_title": "1 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "1 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 4,
        "verse_number": 14,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 4:14",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 4:14",
        "scripture_text": "And when Eli heard the noise of the crying, he said, What meaneth the noise of this tumult? And the man came in hastily, and told Eli."
