        "book_title": "1 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "1 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 4,
        "verse_number": 21,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 4:21",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 4:21",
        "scripture_text": "And she named the child I-chabod, saying, The glory is departed from Israel: because the ark of God was taken, and because of her father in law and her husband."
