        "book_title": "1 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "1 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 8,
        "verse_number": 18,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 8:18",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 8:18",
        "scripture_text": "And ye shall cry out in that day because of your king which ye shall have chosen you; and the Lord will not hear you in that day."
