        "book_title": "1 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "1 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 8,
        "verse_number": 19,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 8:19",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 8:19",
        "scripture_text": "Nevertheless the people refused to obey the voice of Samuel; and they said, Nay; but we will have a king over us;"
