        "verse_number": 50,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 14:50",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 14:50",
        "scripture_text": "And the name of Saul's wife was Ahinoam, the daughter of Ahimaaz: and the name of the captain of his host was Abner, the son of Ner, Saul's uncle."
