        "book_title": "1 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "1 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 15,
        "verse_number": 1,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 15:1",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 15:1",
        "scripture_text": "Samuel also said unto Saul, The Lord sent me to anoint thee to be king over his people, over Israel: now therefore hearken thou unto the voice of the words of the Lord."
