        "book_title": "1 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "1 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 15,
        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 15:2",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 15:2",
        "scripture_text": "Thus saith the Lord of hosts, I remember that which Amalek did to Israel, how he laid wait for him in the way, when he came up from Egypt."
