        "book_title": "1 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "1 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 15,
        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 15:3",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 15:3",
        "scripture_text": "Now go and smite Amalek, and utterly destroy all that they have, and spare them not; but slay both man and woman, infant and suckling, ox and sheep, camel and ass."
