        "book_title": "1 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "1 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 15,
        "verse_number": 20,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 15:20",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 15:20",
        "scripture_text": "And Saul said unto Samuel, Yea, I have obeyed the voice of the Lord, and have gone the way which the Lord sent me, and have brought Agag the king of Amalek, and have utterly destroyed the Amalekites."
