        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "1 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "1 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 15,
        "verse_number": 32,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 15:32",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 15:32",
        "scripture_text": "Then said Samuel, Bring ye hither to me Agag the king of the Amalekites. And Agag came unto him delicately. And Agag said, Surely the bitterness of death is past."
