        "verse_number": 35,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 15:35",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 15:35",
        "scripture_text": "And Samuel came no more to see Saul until the day of his death: nevertheless Samuel mourned for Saul: and the Lord repented that he had made Saul king over Israel."
