        "book_short_title": "1 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 16,
        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 16:4",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 16:4",
        "scripture_text": "And Samuel did that which the Lord spake, and came to Beth-lehem. And the elders of the town trembled at his coming, and said, Comest thou peaceably?"
