        "book_title": "1 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "1 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 16,
        "verse_number": 9,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 16:9",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 16:9",
        "scripture_text": "Then Jesse made Shammah to pass by. And he said, Neither hath the Lord chosen this."
