        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 17:45",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 17:45",
        "scripture_text": "Then said David to the Philistine, Thou comest to me with a sword, and with a spear, and with a shield: but I come to thee in the name of the Lord of hosts, the God of the armies of Israel, whom thou hast defied."
