        "book_title": "1 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "1 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 17,
        "verse_number": 46,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 17:46",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 17:46",
        "scripture_text": "This day will the Lord deliver thee into mine hand; and I will smite thee, and take thine head from thee; and I will give the carcases of the host of the Philistines this day unto the fowls of the air, and to the wild beasts of the earth; that all the earth may know that there is a God in Israel."
