        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 17:48",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 17:48",
        "scripture_text": "And it came to pass, when the Philistine arose, and came and drew nigh to meet David, that David hasted, and ran toward the army to meet the Philistine."
