        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 18:6",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 18:6",
        "scripture_text": "And it came to pass as they came, when David was returned from the slaughter of the Philistine, that the women came out of all cities of Israel, singing and dancing, to meet king Saul, with tabrets, with joy, and with instruments of musick."
