        "book_title": "1 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "1 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 18,
        "verse_number": 8,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 18:8",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 18:8",
        "scripture_text": "And Saul was very wroth, and the saying displeased him; and he said, They have ascribed unto David ten thousands, and to me they have ascribed but thousands: and what can he have more but the kingdom?"
