        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 21:5",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 21:5",
        "scripture_text": "And David answered the priest, and said unto him, Of a truth women have been kept from us about these three days, since I came out, and the vessels of the young men are holy, and the bread is in a manner common, yea, though it were sanctified this day in the vessel."
