        "verse_number": 21,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 30:21",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 30:21",
        "scripture_text": "And David came to the two hundred men, which were so faint that they could not follow David, whom they had made also to abide at the brook Besor: and they went forth to meet David, and to meet the people that were with him: and when David came near to the people, he saluted them."
