        "verse_number": 1,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 31:1",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 31:1",
        "scripture_text": "Now the Philistines fought against Israel: and the men of Israel fled from before the Philistines, and fell down slain in mount Gilboa."
