        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "1 Samuel 31:4",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Sam. 31:4",
        "scripture_text": "Then said Saul unto his armourbearer, Draw thy sword, and thrust me through therewith; lest these uncircumcised come and thrust me through, and abuse me. But his armourbearer would not; for he was sore afraid. Therefore Saul took a sword, and fell upon it."
