        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 1:2",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 1:2",
        "scripture_text": "It came even to pass on the third day, that, behold, a man came out of the camp from Saul with his clothes rent, and earth upon his head: and so it was, when he came to David, that he fell to the earth, and did obeisance."
