        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 1:4",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 1:4",
        "scripture_text": "And David said unto him, How went the matter? I pray thee, tell me. And he answered, That the people are fled from the battle, and many of the people also are fallen and dead; and Saul and Jonathan his son are dead also."
