        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 1:6",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 1:6",
        "scripture_text": "And the young man that told him said, As I happened by chance upon mount Gilboa, behold, Saul leaned upon his spear; and, lo, the chariots and horsemen followed hard after him."
