        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 1:12",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 1:12",
        "scripture_text": "And they mourned, and wept, and fasted until even, for Saul, and for Jonathan his son, and for the people of the Lord, and for the house of Israel; because they were fallen by the sword."
