        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 2,
        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 2:2",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 2:2",
        "scripture_text": "So David went up thither, and his two wives also, Ahinoam the Jezreelitess, and Abigail Nabal's wife the Carmelite."
