        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 2,
        "verse_number": 22,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 2:22",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 2:22",
        "scripture_text": "And Abner said again to Asahel, Turn thee aside from following me: wherefore should I smite thee to the ground? how then should I hold up my face to Joab thy brother?"
