        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 2,
        "verse_number": 23,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 2:23",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 2:23",
        "scripture_text": "Howbeit he refused to turn aside: wherefore Abner with the hinder end of the spear smote him under the fifth rib, that the spear came out behind him; and he fell down there, and died in the same place: and it came to pass, that as many as came to the place where Asahel fell down and died stood still."
