        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 2,
        "verse_number": 27,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 2:27",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 2:27",
        "scripture_text": "And Joab said, As God liveth, unless thou hadst spoken, surely then in the morning the people had gone up every one from following his brother."
