        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 2,
        "verse_number": 32,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 2:32",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 2:32",
        "scripture_text": "And they took up Asahel, and buried him in the sepulchre of his father, which was in Beth-lehem. And Joab and his men went all night, and they came to Hebron at break of day."
