        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 3,
        "verse_number": 19,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 3:19",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 3:19",
        "scripture_text": "And Abner also spake in the ears of Benjamin: and Abner went also to speak in the ears of David in Hebron all that seemed good to Israel, and that seemed good to the whole house of Benjamin."
