        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 3:24",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 3:24",
        "scripture_text": "Then Joab came to the king, and said, What hast thou done? behold, Abner came unto thee; why is it that thou hast sent him away, and he is quite gone?"
