        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 3:25",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 3:25",
        "scripture_text": "Thou knowest Abner the son of Ner, that he came to deceive thee, and to know thy going out and thy coming in, and to know all that thou doest."
