        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 3,
        "verse_number": 28,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 3:28",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 3:28",
        "scripture_text": "And afterward when David heard it, he said, I and my kingdom are guiltless before the Lord for ever from the blood of Abner the son of Ner:"
