        "verse_number": 1,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 4:1",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 4:1",
        "scripture_text": "And when Saul's son heard that Abner was dead in Hebron, his hands were feeble, and all the Israelites were troubled."
