        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 4,
        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 4:2",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 4:2",
        "scripture_text": "And Saul's son had two men that were captains of bands: the name of the one was Baanah, and the name of the other Rechab, the sons of Rimmon a Beerothite, of the children of Benjamin: (for Beeroth also was reckoned to Benjamin:"
