        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 4:10",
        "scripture_text": "When one told me, saying, Behold, Saul is dead, thinking to have brought good tidings, I took hold of him, and slew him in Ziklag, who thought that I would have given him a reward for his tidings:"
