        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 5:24",
        "scripture_text": "And let it be, when thou hearest the sound of a going in the tops of the mulberry trees, that then thou shalt bestir thyself: for then shall the Lord go out before thee, to smite the host of the Philistines."
