        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 8:4",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 8:4",
        "scripture_text": "And David took from him a thousand chariots, and seven hundred horsemen, and twenty thousand footmen: and David houghed all the chariot horses, but reserved of them for an hundred chariots."
