        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 8,
        "verse_number": 5,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 8:5",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 8:5",
        "scripture_text": "And when the Syrians of Damascus came to succour Hadadezer king of Zobah, David slew of the Syrians two and twenty thousand men."
