        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 8,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 8:6",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 8:6",
        "scripture_text": "Then David put garrisons in Syria of Damascus: and the Syrians became servants to David, and brought gifts. And the Lord preserved David whithersoever he went."
