        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 8:17",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 8:17",
        "scripture_text": "And Zadok the son of Ahitub, and Ahimelech the son of Abiathar, were the priests; and Seraiah was the scribe;"
