        "chapter_number": 11,
        "verse_number": 9,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 11:9",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 11:9",
        "scripture_text": "But Uriah slept at the door of the king's house with all the servants of his lord, and went not down to his house."
