        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 11,
        "verse_number": 12,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 11:12",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 11:12",
        "scripture_text": "And David said to Uriah, Tarry here to day also, and to morrow I will let thee depart. So Uriah abode in Jerusalem that day, and the morrow."
