        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 11,
        "verse_number": 13,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 11:13",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 11:13",
        "scripture_text": "And when David had called him, he did eat and drink before him; and he made him drunk: and at even he went out to lie on his bed with the servants of his lord, but went not down to his house."
