        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 11,
        "verse_number": 14,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 11:14",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 11:14",
        "scripture_text": "And it came to pass in the morning, that David wrote a letter to Joab, and sent it by the hand of Uriah."
