        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 11:15",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 11:15",
        "scripture_text": "And he wrote in the letter, saying, Set ye Uriah in the forefront of the hottest battle, and retire ye from him, that he may be smitten, and die."
