        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 11,
        "verse_number": 16,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 11:16",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 11:16",
        "scripture_text": "And it came to pass, when Joab observed the city, that he assigned Uriah unto a place where he knew that valiant men were."
