        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 11,
        "verse_number": 25,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 11:25",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 11:25",
        "scripture_text": "Then David said unto the messenger, Thus shalt thou say unto Joab, Let not this thing displease thee, for the sword devoureth one as well as another: make thy battle more strong against the city, and overthrow it: and encourage thou him."
