        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 12,
        "verse_number": 22,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 12:22",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 12:22",
        "scripture_text": "And he said, While the child was yet alive, I fasted and wept: for I said, Who can tell whether God will be gracious to me, that the child may live?"
