        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 12,
        "verse_number": 30,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 12:30",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 12:30",
        "scripture_text": "And he took their king's crown from off his head, the weight whereof was a talent of gold with the precious stones: and it was set on David's head. And he brought forth the spoil of the city in great abundance."
