        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 14,
        "verse_number": 27,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 14:27",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 14:27",
        "scripture_text": "And unto Absalom there were born three sons, and one daughter, whose name was Tamar: she was a woman of a fair countenance."
