        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 16:11",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 16:11",
        "scripture_text": "And David said to Abishai, and to all his servants, Behold, my son, which came forth of my bowels, seeketh my life: how much more now may this Benjamite do it? let him alone, and let him curse; for the Lord hath bidden him."
