        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 18:12",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 18:12",
        "scripture_text": "And the man said unto Joab, Though I should receive a thousand shekels of silver in mine hand, yet would I not put forth mine hand against the king's son: for in our hearing the king charged thee and Abishai and Ittai, saying, Beware that none touch the young man Absalom."
