        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 21,
        "verse_number": 21,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 21:21",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 21:21",
        "scripture_text": "And when he defied Israel, Jonathan the son of Shimea the brother of David slew him."
