        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 21,
        "verse_number": 22,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 21:22",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 21:22",
        "scripture_text": "These four were born to the giant in Gath, and fell by the hand of David, and by the hand of his servants."
