        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 22,
        "verse_number": 21,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 22:21",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 22:21",
        "scripture_text": "The Lord rewarded me according to my righteousness: according to the cleanness of my hands hath he recompensed me."
