        "book_title": "2 Samuel",
        "book_short_title": "2 Sam.",
        "chapter_number": 22,
        "verse_number": 42,
        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 22:42",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 22:42",
        "scripture_text": "They looked, but there was none to save; even unto the Lord, but he answered them not."
