        "verse_title": "2 Samuel 22:49",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Sam. 22:49",
        "scripture_text": "And that bringeth me forth from mine enemies: thou also hast lifted me up on high above them that rose up against me: thou hast delivered me from the violent man."
