        "verse_title": "1 Kings 4:31",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 4:31",
        "scripture_text": "For he was wiser than all men; than Ethan the Ezrahite, and Heman, and Chalcol, and Darda, the sons of Mahol: and his fame was in all nations round about."
