        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 4:33",
        "scripture_text": "And he spake of trees, from the cedar tree that is in Lebanon even unto the hyssop that springeth out of the wall: he spake also of beasts, and of fowl, and of creeping things, and of fishes."
