        "book_title": "1 Kings",
        "book_short_title": "1 Kgs.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 1,
        "verse_title": "1 Kings 5:1",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 5:1",
        "scripture_text": "And Hiram king of Tyre sent his servants unto Solomon; for he had heard that they had anointed him king in the room of his father: for Hiram was ever a lover of David."
