        "verse_title": "1 Kings 6:5",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 6:5",
        "scripture_text": "And against the wall of the house he built chambers round about, against the walls of the house round about, both of the temple and of the oracle: and he made chambers round about:"
