        "book_short_title": "1 Kgs.",
        "chapter_number": 6,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "1 Kings 6:6",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 6:6",
        "scripture_text": "The nethermost chamber was five cubits broad, and the middle was six cubits broad, and the third was seven cubits broad: for without in the wall of the house he made narrowed rests round about, that the beams should not be fastened in the walls of the house."
