        "book_title": "1 Kings",
        "book_short_title": "1 Kgs.",
        "chapter_number": 6,
        "verse_number": 8,
        "verse_title": "1 Kings 6:8",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 6:8",
        "scripture_text": "The door for the middle chamber was in the right side of the house: and they went up with winding stairs into the middle chamber, and out of the middle into the third."
