        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "1 Kings",
        "book_short_title": "1 Kgs.",
        "chapter_number": 9,
        "verse_number": 13,
        "verse_title": "1 Kings 9:13",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 9:13",
        "scripture_text": "And he said, What cities are these which thou hast given me, my brother? And he called them the land of Cabul unto this day."
