        "verse_title": "1 Kings 9:15",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 9:15",
        "scripture_text": "And this is the reason of the levy which king Solomon raised; for to build the house of the Lord, and his own house, and Millo, and the wall of Jerusalem, and Hazor, and Megiddo, and Gezer."
