        "verse_title": "1 Kings 12:28",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 12:28",
        "scripture_text": "Whereupon the king took counsel, and made two calves of gold, and said unto them, It is too much for you to go up to Jerusalem: behold thy gods, O Israel, which brought thee up out of the land of Egypt."
