        "book_title": "1 Kings",
        "book_short_title": "1 Kgs.",
        "chapter_number": 13,
        "verse_number": 22,
        "verse_title": "1 Kings 13:22",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 13:22",
        "scripture_text": "But camest back, and hast eaten bread and drunk water in the place, of the which the Lord did say to thee, Eat no bread, and drink no water; thy carcase shall not come unto the sepulchre of thy fathers."
