        "book_title": "1 Kings",
        "book_short_title": "1 Kgs.",
        "chapter_number": 13,
        "verse_number": 25,
        "verse_title": "1 Kings 13:25",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 13:25",
        "scripture_text": "And, behold, men passed by, and saw the carcase cast in the way, and the lion standing by the carcase: and they came and told it in the city where the old prophet dwelt."
