        "book_title": "1 Kings",
        "book_short_title": "1 Kgs.",
        "chapter_number": 18,
        "verse_number": 34,
        "verse_title": "1 Kings 18:34",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 18:34",
        "scripture_text": "And he said, Do it the second time. And they did it the second time. And he said, Do it the third time. And they did it the third time."
