        "verse_title": "1 Kings 20:20",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 20:20",
        "scripture_text": "And they slew every one his man: and the Syrians fled; and Israel pursued them: and Ben-hadad the king of Syria escaped on an horse with the horsemen."
