        "verse_title": "1 Kings 20:22",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 20:22",
        "scripture_text": "And the prophet came to the king of Israel, and said unto him, Go, strengthen thyself, and mark, and see what thou doest: for at the return of the year the king of Syria will come up against thee."
