        "book_title": "1 Kings",
        "book_short_title": "1 Kgs.",
        "chapter_number": 20,
        "verse_number": 33,
        "verse_title": "1 Kings 20:33",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 20:33",
        "scripture_text": "Now the men did diligently observe whether any thing would come from him, and did hastily catch it: and they said, Thy brother Ben-hadad. Then he said, Go ye, bring him. Then Ben-hadad came forth to him; and he caused him to come up into the chariot."
