        "verse_number": 37,
        "verse_title": "1 Kings 20:37",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 20:37",
        "scripture_text": "Then he found another man, and said, Smite me, I pray thee. And the man smote him, so that in smiting he wounded him."
