        "verse_title": "1 Kings 21:20",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 21:20",
        "scripture_text": "And Ahab said to Elijah, Hast thou found me, O mine enemy? And he answered, I have found thee: because thou hast sold thyself to work evil in the sight of the Lord."
