        "verse_title": "1 Kings 21:27",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 21:27",
        "scripture_text": "And it came to pass, when Ahab heard those words, that he rent his clothes, and put sackcloth upon his flesh, and fasted, and lay in sackcloth, and went softly."
