        "verse_title": "1 Kings 21:29",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 21:29",
        "scripture_text": "Seest thou how Ahab humbleth himself before me? because he humbleth himself before me, I will not bring the evil in his days: but in his son's days will I bring the evil upon his house."
