        "verse_title": "1 Kings 22:12",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 22:12",
        "scripture_text": "And all the prophets prophesied so, saying, Go up to Ramoth-gilead, and prosper: for the Lord shall deliver it into the king's hand."
