        "verse_title": "1 Kings 22:13",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 22:13",
        "scripture_text": "And the messenger that was gone to call Micaiah spake unto him, saying, Behold now, the words of the prophets declare good unto the king with one mouth: let thy word, I pray thee, be like the word of one of them, and speak that which is good."
