        "verse_title": "1 Kings 22:19",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 22:19",
        "scripture_text": "And he said, Hear thou therefore the word of the Lord: I saw the Lord sitting on his throne, and all the host of heaven standing by him on his right hand and on his left."
