        "verse_title": "1 Kings 22:20",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 22:20",
        "scripture_text": "And the Lord said, Who shall persuade Ahab, that he may go up and fall at Ramoth-gilead? And one said on this manner, and another said on that manner."
