        "verse_title": "1 Kings 22:23",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 22:23",
        "scripture_text": "Now therefore, behold, the Lord hath put a lying spirit in the mouth of all these thy prophets, and the Lord hath spoken evil concerning thee."
