        "verse_title": "1 Kings 22:24",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 22:24",
        "scripture_text": "But Zedekiah the son of Chenaanah went near, and smote Micaiah on the cheek, and said, Which way went the Spirit of the Lord from me to speak unto thee?"
