        "verse_title": "1 Kings 22:49",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Kgs. 22:49",
        "scripture_text": "Then said Ahaziah the son of Ahab unto Jehoshaphat, Let my servants go with thy servants in the ships. But Jehoshaphat would not."
