        "verse_title": "2 Kings 4:41",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Kgs. 4:41",
        "scripture_text": "But he said, Then bring meal. And he cast it into the pot; and he said, Pour out for the people, that they may eat. And there was no harm in the pot."
