        "verse_number": 43,
        "verse_title": "2 Kings 4:43",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Kgs. 4:43",
        "scripture_text": "And his servitor said, What, should I set this before an hundred men? He said again, Give the people, that they may eat: for thus saith the Lord, They shall eat, and shall leave thereof."
