        "book_title": "2 Kings",
        "book_short_title": "2 Kgs.",
        "chapter_number": 6,
        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "2 Kings 6:2",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Kgs. 6:2",
        "scripture_text": "Let us go, we pray thee, unto Jordan, and take thence every man a beam, and let us make us a place there, where we may dwell. And he answered, Go ye."
