        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "2 Kings",
        "book_short_title": "2 Kgs.",
        "chapter_number": 6,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "2 Kings 6:6",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Kgs. 6:6",
        "scripture_text": "And the man of God said, Where fell it? And he shewed him the place. And he cut down a stick, and cast it in thither; and the iron did swim."
