        "book_title": "2 Kings",
        "book_short_title": "2 Kgs.",
        "chapter_number": 6,
        "verse_number": 11,
        "verse_title": "2 Kings 6:11",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Kgs. 6:11",
        "scripture_text": "Therefore the heart of the king of Syria was sore troubled for this thing; and he called his servants, and said unto them, Will ye not shew me which of us is for the king of Israel?"
