        "book_title": "2 Kings",
        "book_short_title": "2 Kgs.",
        "chapter_number": 6,
        "verse_number": 12,
        "verse_title": "2 Kings 6:12",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Kgs. 6:12",
        "scripture_text": "And one of his servants said, None, my lord, O king: but Elisha, the prophet that is in Israel, telleth the king of Israel the words that thou speakest in thy bedchamber."
