        "verse_title": "2 Kings 10:2",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Kgs. 10:2",
        "scripture_text": "Now as soon as this letter cometh to you, seeing your master's sons are with you, and there are with you chariots and horses, a fenced city also, and armour;"
