        "book_title": "2 Kings",
        "book_short_title": "2 Kgs.",
        "chapter_number": 10,
        "verse_number": 10,
        "verse_title": "2 Kings 10:10",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Kgs. 10:10",
        "scripture_text": "Know now that there shall fall unto the earth nothing of the word of the Lord, which the Lord spake concerning the house of Ahab: for the Lord hath done that which he spake by his servant Elijah."
