        "book_title": "2 Kings",
        "book_short_title": "2 Kgs.",
        "chapter_number": 10,
        "verse_number": 32,
        "verse_title": "2 Kings 10:32",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Kgs. 10:32",
        "scripture_text": "In those days the Lord began to cut Israel short: and Hazael smote them in all the coasts of Israel;"
