        "verse_number": 1,
        "verse_title": "2 Kings 11:1",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Kgs. 11:1",
        "scripture_text": "And when Athaliah the mother of Ahaziah saw that her son was dead, she arose and destroyed all the seed royal."
