        "verse_short_title": "2 Kgs. 25:4",
        "scripture_text": "And the city was broken up, and all the men of war fled by night by the way of the gate between two walls, which is by the king's garden: (now the Chaldees were against the city round about:) and the king went the way toward the plain."
