        "verse_title": "1 Chronicles 4:27",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Chr. 4:27",
        "scripture_text": "And Shimei had sixteen sons and six daughters; but his brethren had not many children, neither did all their family multiply, like to the children of Judah."
