        "verse_title": "1 Chronicles 4:31",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Chr. 4:31",
        "scripture_text": "And at Beth-marcaboth, and Hazar-susim, and at Beth-birei, and at Shaaraim. These were their cities unto the reign of David."
