        "verse_number": 39,
        "verse_title": "1 Chronicles 4:39",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Chr. 4:39",
        "scripture_text": "And they went to the entrance of Gedor, even unto the east side of the valley, to seek pasture for their flocks."
