        "book_title": "1 Chronicles",
        "book_short_title": "1 Chr.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "1 Chronicles 5:3",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Chr. 5:3",
        "scripture_text": "The sons, I say, of Reuben the firstborn of Israel were, Hanoch, and Pallu, Hezron, and Carmi."
