        "book_title": "1 Chronicles",
        "book_short_title": "1 Chr.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 10,
        "verse_title": "1 Chronicles 5:10",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Chr. 5:10",
        "scripture_text": "And in the days of Saul they made war with the Hagarites, who fell by their hand: and they dwelt in their tents throughout all the east land of Gilead."
