        "verse_short_title": "1 Chr. 14:11",
        "scripture_text": "So they came up to Baal-perazim; and David smote them there. Then David said, God hath broken in upon mine enemies by mine hand like the breaking forth of waters: therefore they called the name of that place Baal-perazim."
