        "verse_title": "1 Chronicles 14:15",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Chr. 14:15",
        "scripture_text": "And it shall be, when thou shalt hear a sound of going in the tops of the mulberry trees, that then thou shalt go out to battle: for God is gone forth before thee to smite the host of the Philistines."
