        "verse_short_title": "2 Chr. 2:8",
        "scripture_text": "Send me also cedar trees, fir trees, and algum trees, out of Lebanon: for I know that thy servants can skill to cut timber in Lebanon; and, behold, my servants shall be with thy servants,"
