        "chapter_number": 9,
        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "2 Chronicles 9:2",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Chr. 9:2",
        "scripture_text": "And Solomon told her all her questions: and there was nothing hid from Solomon which he told her not."
