        "verse_title": "2 Chronicles 9:16",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Chr. 9:16",
        "scripture_text": "And three hundred shields made he of beaten gold: three hundred shekels of gold went to one shield. And the king put them in the house of the forest of Lebanon."
