        "verse_number": 19,
        "verse_title": "2 Chronicles 9:19",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Chr. 9:19",
        "scripture_text": "And twelve lions stood there on the one side and on the other upon the six steps. There was not the like made in any kingdom."
