        "book_title": "2 Chronicles",
        "book_short_title": "2 Chr.",
        "chapter_number": 9,
        "verse_number": 20,
        "verse_title": "2 Chronicles 9:20",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Chr. 9:20",
        "scripture_text": "And all the drinking vessels of king Solomon were of gold, and all the vessels of the house of the forest of Lebanon were of pure gold: none were of silver; it was not any thing accounted of in the days of Solomon."
