        "book_title": "2 Chronicles",
        "book_short_title": "2 Chr.",
        "chapter_number": 9,
        "verse_number": 25,
        "verse_title": "2 Chronicles 9:25",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Chr. 9:25",
        "scripture_text": "And Solomon had four thousand stalls for horses and chariots, and twelve thousand horsemen; whom he bestowed in the chariot cities, and with the king at Jerusalem."
