        "book_title": "2 Chronicles",
        "book_short_title": "2 Chr.",
        "chapter_number": 20,
        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "2 Chronicles 20:2",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Chr. 20:2",
        "scripture_text": "Then there came some that told Jehoshaphat, saying, There cometh a great multitude against thee from beyond the sea on this side Syria; and, behold, they be in Hazazon-tamar, which is En-gedi."
