        "book_title": "2 Chronicles",
        "book_short_title": "2 Chr.",
        "chapter_number": 20,
        "verse_number": 22,
        "verse_title": "2 Chronicles 20:22",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Chr. 20:22",
        "scripture_text": "And when they began to sing and to praise, the Lord set ambushments against the children of Ammon, Moab, and mount Seir, which were come against Judah; and they were smitten."
