        "chapter_number": 2,
        "verse_number": 69,
        "verse_title": "Ezra 2:69",
        "verse_short_title": "Ezra 2:69",
        "scripture_text": "They gave after their ability unto the treasure of the work threescore and one thousand drams of gold, and five thousand pound of silver, and one hundred priests' garments."
