        "book_title": "Esther",
        "book_short_title": "Esth.",
        "chapter_number": 4,
        "verse_number": 14,
        "verse_title": "Esther 4:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Esth. 4:14",
        "scripture_text": "For if thou altogether holdest thy peace at this time, then shall there enlargement and deliverance arise to the Jews from another place; but thou and thy father's house shall be destroyed: and who knoweth whether thou art come to the kingdom for such a time as this?"
