        "verse_title": "Esther 8:7",
        "verse_short_title": "Esth. 8:7",
        "scripture_text": "Then the king Ahasuerus said unto Esther the queen and to Mordecai the Jew, Behold, I have given Esther the house of Haman, and him they have hanged upon the gallows, because he laid his hand upon the Jews."
