        "verse_title": "Esther 8:11",
        "verse_short_title": "Esth. 8:11",
        "scripture_text": "Wherein the king granted the Jews which were in every city to gather themselves together, and to stand for their life, to destroy, to slay, and to cause to perish, all the power of the people and province that would assault them, both little ones and women, and to take the spoil of them for a prey,"
