        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "Job 7:4",
        "verse_short_title": "Job 7:4",
        "scripture_text": "When I lie down, I say, When shall I arise, and the night be gone? and I am full of tossings to and fro unto the dawning of the day."
