        "chapter_number": 135,
        "verse_number": 7,
        "verse_title": "Psalms 135:7",
        "verse_short_title": "Ps. 135:7",
        "scripture_text": "He causeth the vapours to ascend from the ends of the earth; he maketh lightnings for the rain; he bringeth the wind out of his treasuries."
