        "verse_number": 24,
        "verse_title": "Ecclesiastes 2:24",
        "verse_short_title": "Eccl. 2:24",
        "scripture_text": "There is nothing better for a man, than that he should eat and drink, and that he should make his soul enjoy good in his labour. This also I saw, that it was from the hand of God."
