        "book_title": "Ecclesiastes",
        "book_short_title": "Eccl.",
        "chapter_number": 3,
        "verse_number": 11,
        "verse_title": "Ecclesiastes 3:11",
        "verse_short_title": "Eccl. 3:11",
        "scripture_text": "He hath made every thing beautiful in his time: also he hath set the world in their heart, so that no man can find out the work that God maketh from the beginning to the end."
