        "book_title": "Ecclesiastes",
        "book_short_title": "Eccl.",
        "chapter_number": 3,
        "verse_number": 14,
        "verse_title": "Ecclesiastes 3:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Eccl. 3:14",
        "scripture_text": "I know that, whatsoever God doeth, it shall be for ever: nothing can be put to it, nor any thing taken from it: and God doeth it, that men should fear before him."
