        "book_title": "Ecclesiastes",
        "book_short_title": "Eccl.",
        "chapter_number": 3,
        "verse_number": 18,
        "verse_title": "Ecclesiastes 3:18",
        "verse_short_title": "Eccl. 3:18",
        "scripture_text": "I said in mine heart concerning the estate of the sons of men, that God might manifest them, and that they might see that they themselves are beasts."
