        "book_title": "Ecclesiastes",
        "book_short_title": "Eccl.",
        "chapter_number": 4,
        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "Ecclesiastes 4:4",
        "verse_short_title": "Eccl. 4:4",
        "scripture_text": "Again, I considered all travail, and every right work, that for this a man is envied of his neighbour. This is also vanity and vexation of spirit."
