        "book_title": "Ecclesiastes",
        "book_short_title": "Eccl.",
        "chapter_number": 4,
        "verse_number": 10,
        "verse_title": "Ecclesiastes 4:10",
        "verse_short_title": "Eccl. 4:10",
        "scripture_text": "For if they fall, the one will lift up his fellow: but woe to him that is alone when he falleth; for he hath not another to help him up."
