        "verse_title": "Ecclesiastes 4:16",
        "verse_short_title": "Eccl. 4:16",
        "scripture_text": "There is no end of all the people, even of all that have been before them: they also that come after shall not rejoice in him. Surely this also is vanity and vexation of spirit."
