        "verse_title": "Ecclesiastes 5:2",
        "verse_short_title": "Eccl. 5:2",
        "scripture_text": "Be not rash with thy mouth, and let not thine heart be hasty to utter any thing before God: for God is in heaven, and thou upon earth: therefore let thy words be few."
