        "book_title": "Ecclesiastes",
        "book_short_title": "Eccl.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "Ecclesiastes 5:4",
        "verse_short_title": "Eccl. 5:4",
        "scripture_text": "When thou vowest a vow unto God, defer not to pay it; for he hath no pleasure in fools: pay that which thou hast vowed."
