        "book_title": "Ecclesiastes",
        "book_short_title": "Eccl.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Ecclesiastes 5:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Eccl. 5:6",
        "scripture_text": "Suffer not thy mouth to cause thy flesh to sin; neither say thou before the angel, that it was an error: wherefore should God be angry at thy voice, and destroy the work of thine hands?"
