        "book_title": "Ecclesiastes",
        "book_short_title": "Eccl.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 7,
        "verse_title": "Ecclesiastes 5:7",
        "verse_short_title": "Eccl. 5:7",
        "scripture_text": "For in the multitude of dreams and many words there are also divers vanities: but fear thou God."
