        "verse_title": "Song of Solomon 1:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Song. 1:6",
        "scripture_text": "Look not upon me, because I am black, because the sun hath looked upon me: my mother's children were angry with me; they made me the keeper of the vineyards; but mine own vineyard have I not kept."
