        "book_title": "Isaiah",
        "book_short_title": "Isa.",
        "chapter_number": 14,
        "verse_number": 13,
        "verse_title": "Isaiah 14:13",
        "verse_short_title": "Isa. 14:13",
        "scripture_text": "For thou hast said in thine heart, I will ascend into heaven, I will exalt my throne above the stars of God: I will sit also upon the mount of the congregation, in the sides of the north:"
