        "book_short_title": "Isa.",
        "chapter_number": 16,
        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "Isaiah 16:2",
        "verse_short_title": "Isa. 16:2",
        "scripture_text": "For it shall be, that, as a wandering bird cast out of the nest, so the daughters of Moab shall be at the fords of Arnon."
