        "book_title": "Isaiah",
        "book_short_title": "Isa.",
        "chapter_number": 16,
        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "Isaiah 16:4",
        "verse_short_title": "Isa. 16:4",
        "scripture_text": "Let mine outcasts dwell with thee, Moab; be thou a covert to them from the face of the spoiler: for the extortioner is at an end, the spoiler ceaseth, the oppressors are consumed out of the land."
