        "book_title": "Isaiah",
        "book_short_title": "Isa.",
        "chapter_number": 16,
        "verse_number": 12,
        "verse_title": "Isaiah 16:12",
        "verse_short_title": "Isa. 16:12",
        "scripture_text": "And it shall come to pass, when it is seen that Moab is weary on the high place, that he shall come to his sanctuary to pray; but he shall not prevail."
