        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "Isaiah",
        "book_short_title": "Isa.",
        "chapter_number": 16,
        "verse_number": 14,
        "verse_title": "Isaiah 16:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Isa. 16:14",
        "scripture_text": "But now the Lord hath spoken, saying, Within three years, as the years of an hireling, and the glory of Moab shall be contemned, with all that great multitude; and the remnant shall be very small and feeble."
