        "verse_title": "Isaiah 17:3",
        "verse_short_title": "Isa. 17:3",
        "scripture_text": "The fortress also shall cease from Ephraim, and the kingdom from Damascus, and the remnant of Syria: they shall be as the glory of the children of Israel, saith the Lord of hosts."
