        "verse_number": 9,
        "verse_title": "Isaiah 17:9",
        "verse_short_title": "Isa. 17:9",
        "scripture_text": "In that day shall his strong cities be as a forsaken bough, and an uppermost branch, which they left because of the children of Israel: and there shall be desolation."
