        "verse_title": "Isaiah 17:11",
        "verse_short_title": "Isa. 17:11",
        "scripture_text": "In the day shalt thou make thy plant to grow, and in the morning shalt thou make thy seed to flourish: but the harvest shall be a heap in the day of grief and of desperate sorrow."
