        "verse_title": "Isaiah 18:7",
        "verse_short_title": "Isa. 18:7",
        "scripture_text": "In that time shall the present be brought unto the Lord of hosts of a people scattered and peeled, and from a people terrible from their beginning hitherto; a nation meted out and trodden under foot, whose land the rivers have spoiled, to the place of the name of the Lord of hosts, the mount Zion."
