        "chapter_number": 19,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Isaiah 19:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Isa. 19:6",
        "scripture_text": "And they shall turn the rivers far away; and the brooks of defence shall be emptied and dried up: the reeds and flags shall wither."
