        "verse_title": "Isaiah 19:17",
        "verse_short_title": "Isa. 19:17",
        "scripture_text": "And the land of Judah shall be a terror unto Egypt, every one that maketh mention thereof shall be afraid in himself, because of the counsel of the Lord of hosts, which he hath determined against it."
