        "verse_title": "Isaiah 19:18",
        "verse_short_title": "Isa. 19:18",
        "scripture_text": "In that day shall five cities in the land of Egypt speak the language of Canaan, and swear to the Lord of hosts; one shall be called, The city of destruction."
