        "verse_title": "Isaiah 19:20",
        "verse_short_title": "Isa. 19:20",
        "scripture_text": "And it shall be for a sign and for a witness unto the Lord of hosts in the land of Egypt: for they shall cry unto the Lord because of the oppressors, and he shall send them a saviour, and a great one, and he shall deliver them."
