        "verse_number": 18,
        "verse_title": "Isaiah 24:18",
        "verse_short_title": "Isa. 24:18",
        "scripture_text": "And it shall come to pass, that he who fleeth from the noise of the fear shall fall into the pit; and he that cometh up out of the midst of the pit shall be taken in the snare: for the windows from on high are open, and the foundations of the earth do shake."
