        "verse_title": "Isaiah 25:4",
        "verse_short_title": "Isa. 25:4",
        "scripture_text": "For thou hast been a strength to the poor, a strength to the needy in his distress, a refuge from the storm, a shadow from the heat, when the blast of the terrible ones is as a storm against the wall."
