        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Isaiah 25:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Isa. 25:6",
        "scripture_text": "And in this mountain shall the Lord of hosts make unto all people a feast of fat things, a feast of wines on the lees, of fat things full of marrow, of wines on the lees well refined."
