        "verse_title": "Isaiah 25:9",
        "verse_short_title": "Isa. 25:9",
        "scripture_text": "And it shall be said in that day, Lo, this is our God; we have waited for him, and he will save us: this is the Lord; we have waited for him, we will be glad and rejoice in his salvation."
