        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 1:7",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 1:7",
        "scripture_text": "But the Lord said unto me, Say not, I am a child: for thou shalt go to all that I shall send thee, and whatsoever I command thee thou shalt speak."
