        "verse_number": 13,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 1:13",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 1:13",
        "scripture_text": "And the word of the Lord came unto me the second time, saying, What seest thou? And I said, I see a seething pot; and the face thereof is toward the north."
