        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 1:17",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 1:17",
        "scripture_text": "Thou therefore gird up thy loins, and arise, and speak unto them all that I command thee: be not dismayed at their faces, lest I confound thee before them."
