        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 2,
        "verse_number": 15,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 2:15",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 2:15",
        "scripture_text": "The young lions roared upon him, and yelled, and they made his land waste: his cities are burned without inhabitant."
