        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 2,
        "verse_number": 36,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 2:36",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 2:36",
        "scripture_text": "Why gaddest thou about so much to change thy way? thou also shalt be ashamed of Egypt, as thou wast ashamed of Assyria."
