        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 4,
        "verse_number": 22,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 4:22",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 4:22",
        "scripture_text": "For my people is foolish, they have not known me; they are sottish children, and they have none understanding: they are wise to do evil, but to do good they have no knowledge."
