        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 4,
        "verse_number": 26,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 4:26",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 4:26",
        "scripture_text": "I beheld, and, lo, the fruitful place was a wilderness, and all the cities thereof were broken down at the presence of the Lord, and by his fierce anger."
