        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 5:4",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 5:4",
        "scripture_text": "Therefore I said, Surely these are poor; they are foolish: for they know not the way of the Lord, nor the judgment of their God."
