        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 5,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 5:5",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 5:5",
        "scripture_text": "I will get me unto the great men, and will speak unto them; for they have known the way of the Lord, and the judgment of their God: but these have altogether broken the yoke, and burst the bonds."
