        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 5:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 5:6",
        "scripture_text": "Wherefore a lion out of the forest shall slay them, and a wolf of the evenings shall spoil them, a leopard shall watch over their cities: every one that goeth out thence shall be torn in pieces: because their transgressions are many, and their backslidings are increased."
