        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 12,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 5:12",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 5:12",
        "scripture_text": "They have belied the Lord, and said, It is not he; neither shall evil come upon us; neither shall we see sword nor famine:"
