        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 5:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 5:14",
        "scripture_text": "Wherefore thus saith the Lord God of hosts, Because ye speak this word, behold, I will make my words in thy mouth fire, and this people wood, and it shall devour them."
