        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 5:15",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 5:15",
        "scripture_text": "Lo, I will bring a nation upon you from far, O house of Israel, saith the Lord: it is a mighty nation, it is an ancient nation, a nation whose language thou knowest not, neither understandest what they say."
