        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 21,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 5:21",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 5:21",
        "scripture_text": "Hear now this, O foolish people, and without understanding; which have eyes, and see not; which have ears, and hear not:"
