        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 24,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 5:24",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 5:24",
        "scripture_text": "Neither say they in their heart, Let us now fear the Lord our God, that giveth rain, both the former and the latter, in his season: he reserveth unto us the appointed weeks of the harvest."
