        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 28,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 5:28",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 5:28",
        "scripture_text": "They are waxen fat, they shine: yea, they overpass the deeds of the wicked: they judge not the cause, the cause of the fatherless, yet they prosper; and the right of the needy do they not judge."
