        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 6,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 6:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 6:6",
        "scripture_text": "For thus hath the Lord of hosts said, Hew ye down trees, and cast a mount against Jerusalem: this is the city to be visited; she is wholly oppression in the midst of her."
