        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 6,
        "verse_number": 10,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 6:10",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 6:10",
        "scripture_text": "To whom shall I speak, and give warning, that they may hear? behold, their ear is uncircumcised, and they cannot hearken: behold, the word of the Lord is unto them a reproach; they have no delight in it."
