        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 6,
        "verse_number": 11,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 6:11",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 6:11",
        "scripture_text": "Therefore I am full of the fury of the Lord; I am weary with holding in: I will pour it out upon the children abroad, and upon the assembly of young men together: for even the husband with the wife shall be taken, the aged with him that is full of days."
