        "chapter_number": 7,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 7:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 7:6",
        "scripture_text": "If ye oppress not the stranger, the fatherless, and the widow, and shed not innocent blood in this place, neither walk after other gods to your hurt:"
