        "chapter_number": 7,
        "verse_number": 11,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 7:11",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 7:11",
        "scripture_text": "Is this house, which is called by my name, become a den of robbers in your eyes? Behold, even I have seen it, saith the Lord."
