        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 7,
        "verse_number": 28,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 7:28",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 7:28",
        "scripture_text": "But thou shalt say unto them, This is a nation that obeyeth not the voice of the Lord their God, nor receiveth correction: truth is perished, and is cut off from their mouth."
