        "chapter_number": 7,
        "verse_number": 29,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 7:29",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 7:29",
        "scripture_text": "Cut off thine hair, O Jerusalem, and cast it away, and take up a lamentation on high places; for the Lord hath rejected and forsaken the generation of his wrath."
