        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 7,
        "verse_number": 31,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 7:31",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 7:31",
        "scripture_text": "And they have built the high places of Tophet, which is in the valley of the son of Hinnom, to burn their sons and their daughters in the fire; which I commanded them not, neither came it into my heart."
