        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 8,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 8:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 8:6",
        "scripture_text": "I hearkened and heard, but they spake not aright: no man repented him of his wickedness, saying, What have I done? every one turned to his course, as the horse rusheth into the battle."
