        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 8:7",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 8:7",
        "scripture_text": "Yea, the stork in the heaven knoweth her appointed times; and the turtle and the crane and the swallow observe the time of their coming; but my people know not the judgment of the Lord."
