        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 8:8",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 8:8",
        "scripture_text": "How do ye say, We are wise, and the law of the Lord is with us? Lo, certainly in vain made he it; the pen of the scribes is in vain."
