        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 9:5",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 9:5",
        "scripture_text": "And they will deceive every one his neighbour, and will not speak the truth: they have taught their tongue to speak lies, and weary themselves to commit iniquity."
