        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 9:20",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 9:20",
        "scripture_text": "Yet hear the word of the Lord, O ye women, and let your ear receive the word of his mouth, and teach your daughters wailing, and every one her neighbour lamentation."
