        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 9:22",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 9:22",
        "scripture_text": "Speak, Thus saith the Lord, Even the carcases of men shall fall as dung upon the open field, and as the handful after the harvestman, and none shall gather them."
