        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 12,
        "verse_number": 12,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 12:12",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 12:12",
        "scripture_text": "The spoilers are come upon all high places through the wilderness: for the sword of the Lord shall devour from the one end of the land even to the other end of the land: no flesh shall have peace."
