        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 13,
        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 13:3",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 13:3",
        "scripture_text": "And the word of the Lord came unto me the second time, saying,"
