        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 13,
        "verse_number": 7,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 13:7",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 13:7",
        "scripture_text": "Then I went to Euphrates, and digged, and took the girdle from the place where I had hid it: and, behold, the girdle was marred, it was profitable for nothing."
