        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 13,
        "verse_number": 12,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 13:12",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 13:12",
        "scripture_text": "Therefore thou shalt speak unto them this word; Thus saith the Lord God of Israel, Every bottle shall be filled with wine: and they shall say unto thee, Do we not certainly know that every bottle shall be filled with wine?"
