        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 22,
        "verse_number": 21,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 22:21",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 22:21",
        "scripture_text": "I spake unto thee in thy prosperity; but thou saidst, I will not hear. This hath been thy manner from thy youth, that thou obeyedst not my voice."
