        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 23,
        "verse_number": 27,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 23:27",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 23:27",
        "scripture_text": "Which think to cause my people to forget my name by their dreams which they tell every man to his neighbour, as their fathers have forgotten my name for Baal."
