        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 23:39",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 23:39",
        "scripture_text": "Therefore, behold, I, even I, will utterly forget you, and I will forsake you, and the city that I gave you and your fathers, and cast you out of my presence:"
