        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 24:2",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 24:2",
        "scripture_text": "One basket had very good figs, even like the figs that are first ripe: and the other basket had very naughty figs, which could not be eaten, they were so bad."
