        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 24:3",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 24:3",
        "scripture_text": "Then said the Lord unto me, What seest thou, Jeremiah? And I said, Figs; the good figs, very good; and the evil, very evil, that cannot be eaten, they are so evil."
