        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 24,
        "verse_number": 8,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 24:8",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 24:8",
        "scripture_text": "And as the evil figs, which cannot be eaten, they are so evil; surely thus saith the Lord, So will I give Zedekiah the king of Judah, and his princes, and the residue of Jerusalem, that remain in this land, and them that dwell in the land of Egypt:"
