        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 42:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 42:14",
        "scripture_text": "Saying, No; but we will go into the land of Egypt, where we shall see no war, nor hear the sound of the trumpet, nor have hunger of bread; and there will we dwell:"
