        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 42,
        "verse_number": 17,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 42:17",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 42:17",
        "scripture_text": "So shall it be with all the men that set their faces to go into Egypt to sojourn there; they shall die by the sword, by the famine, and by the pestilence: and none of them shall remain or escape from the evil that I will bring upon them."
