        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 42:20",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 42:20",
        "scripture_text": "For ye dissembled in your hearts, when ye sent me unto the Lord your God, saying, Pray for us unto the Lord our God; and according unto all that the Lord our God shall say, so declare unto us, and we will do it."
