        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 43,
        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 43:2",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 43:2",
        "scripture_text": "Then spake Azariah the son of Hoshaiah, and Johanan the son of Kareah, and all the proud men, saying unto Jeremiah, Thou speakest falsely: the Lord our God hath not sent thee to say, Go not into Egypt to sojourn there:"
