        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 43,
        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 43:4",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 43:4",
        "scripture_text": "So Johanan the son of Kareah, and all the captains of the forces, and all the people, obeyed not the voice of the Lord, to dwell in the land of Judah."
