        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 48,
        "verse_number": 39,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 48:39",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 48:39",
        "scripture_text": "They shall howl, saying, How is it broken down! how hath Moab turned the back with shame! so shall Moab be a derision and a dismaying to all them about him."
