        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 48:44",
        "scripture_text": "He that fleeth from the fear shall fall into the pit; and he that getteth up out of the pit shall be taken in the snare: for I will bring upon it, even upon Moab, the year of their visitation, saith the Lord."
