        "book_title": "Jeremiah",
        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 49,
        "verse_number": 9,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 49:9",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 49:9",
        "scripture_text": "If grapegatherers come to thee, would they not leave some gleaning grapes? if thieves by night, they will destroy till they have enough."
