        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 49:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 49:14",
        "scripture_text": "I have heard a rumour from the Lord, and an ambassador is sent unto the heathen, saying, Gather ye together, and come against her, and rise up to the battle."
