        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 49:16",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 49:16",
        "scripture_text": "Thy terribleness hath deceived thee, and the pride of thine heart, O thou that dwellest in the clefts of the rock, that holdest the height of the hill: though thou shouldest make thy nest as high as the eagle, I will bring thee down from thence, saith the Lord."
