        "chapter_number": 49,
        "verse_number": 37,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 49:37",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 49:37",
        "scripture_text": "For I will cause Elam to be dismayed before their enemies, and before them that seek their life: and I will bring evil upon them, even my fierce anger, saith the Lord; and I will send the sword after them, till I have consumed them:"
