        "book_short_title": "Jer.",
        "chapter_number": 51,
        "verse_number": 46,
        "verse_title": "Jeremiah 51:46",
        "verse_short_title": "Jer. 51:46",
        "scripture_text": "And lest your heart faint, and ye fear for the rumour that shall be heard in the land; a rumour shall both come one year, and after that in another year shall come a rumour, and violence in the land, ruler against ruler."
