        "book_title": "Lamentations",
        "book_short_title": "Lam.",
        "chapter_number": 4,
        "verse_number": 17,
        "verse_title": "Lamentations 4:17",
        "verse_short_title": "Lam. 4:17",
        "scripture_text": "As for us, our eyes as yet failed for our vain help: in our watching we have watched for a nation that could not save us."
