        "book_title": "Ezekiel",
        "book_short_title": "Ezek.",
        "chapter_number": 2,
        "verse_number": 7,
        "verse_title": "Ezekiel 2:7",
        "verse_short_title": "Ezek. 2:7",
        "scripture_text": "And thou shalt speak my words unto them, whether they will hear, or whether they will forbear: for they are most rebellious."
