        "chapter_number": 3,
        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "Ezekiel 3:3",
        "verse_short_title": "Ezek. 3:3",
        "scripture_text": "And he said unto me, Son of man, cause thy belly to eat, and fill thy bowels with this roll that I give thee. Then did I eat it; and it was in my mouth as honey for sweetness."
