        "verse_title": "Ezekiel 8:10",
        "verse_short_title": "Ezek. 8:10",
        "scripture_text": "So I went in and saw; and behold every form of creeping things, and abominable beasts, and all the idols of the house of Israel, portrayed upon the wall round about."
