        "verse_title": "Ezekiel 9:8",
        "verse_short_title": "Ezek. 9:8",
        "scripture_text": "And it came to pass, while they were slaying them, and I was left, that I fell upon my face, and cried, and said, Ah Lord God! wilt thou destroy all the residue of Israel in thy pouring out of thy fury upon Jerusalem?"
