        "book_title": "Ezekiel",
        "book_short_title": "Ezek.",
        "chapter_number": 10,
        "verse_number": 1,
        "verse_title": "Ezekiel 10:1",
        "verse_short_title": "Ezek. 10:1",
        "scripture_text": "Then I looked, and, behold, in the firmament that was above the head of the cherubims there appeared over them as it were a sapphire stone, as the appearance of the likeness of a throne."
