        "book_short_title": "Ezek.",
        "chapter_number": 10,
        "verse_number": 11,
        "verse_title": "Ezekiel 10:11",
        "verse_short_title": "Ezek. 10:11",
        "scripture_text": "When they went, they went upon their four sides; they turned not as they went, but to the place whither the head looked they followed it; they turned not as they went."
