        "verse_short_title": "Ezek. 44:2",
        "scripture_text": "Then said the Lord unto me; This gate shall be shut, it shall not be opened, and no man shall enter in by it; because the Lord, the God of Israel, hath entered in by it, therefore it shall be shut."
