        "verse_title": "Ezekiel 44:5",
        "verse_short_title": "Ezek. 44:5",
        "scripture_text": "And the Lord said unto me, Son of man, mark well, and behold with thine eyes, and hear with thine ears all that I say unto thee concerning all the ordinances of the house of the Lord, and all the laws thereof; and mark well the entering in of the house, with every going forth of the sanctuary."
