        "verse_title": "Ezekiel 44:17",
        "verse_short_title": "Ezek. 44:17",
        "scripture_text": "And it shall come to pass, that when they enter in at the gates of the inner court, they shall be clothed with linen garments; and no wool shall come upon them, whiles they minister in the gates of the inner court, and within."
