        "verse_title": "Ezekiel 44:19",
        "verse_short_title": "Ezek. 44:19",
        "scripture_text": "And when they go forth into the utter court, even into the utter court to the people, they shall put off their garments wherein they ministered, and lay them in the holy chambers, and they shall put on other garments; and they shall not sanctify the people with their garments."
