        "verse_number": 30,
        "verse_title": "Ezekiel 44:30",
        "verse_short_title": "Ezek. 44:30",
        "scripture_text": "And the first of all the firstfruits of all things, and every oblation of all, of every sort of your oblations, shall be the priest's: ye shall also give unto the priest the first of your dough, that he may cause the blessing to rest in thine house."
