        "verse_title": "Daniel 4:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Dan. 4:14",
        "scripture_text": "He cried aloud, and said thus, Hew down the tree, and cut off his branches, shake off his leaves, and scatter his fruit: let the beasts get away from under it, and the fowls from his branches:"
