        "book_title": "Daniel",
        "book_short_title": "Dan.",
        "chapter_number": 6,
        "verse_number": 14,
        "verse_title": "Daniel 6:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Dan. 6:14",
        "scripture_text": "Then the king, when he heard these words, was sore displeased with himself, and set his heart on Daniel to deliver him: and he laboured till the going down of the sun to deliver him."
