        "book_title": "Daniel",
        "book_short_title": "Dan.",
        "chapter_number": 6,
        "verse_number": 15,
        "verse_title": "Daniel 6:15",
        "verse_short_title": "Dan. 6:15",
        "scripture_text": "Then these men assembled unto the king, and said unto the king, Know, O king, that the law of the Medes and Persians is, That no decree nor statute which the king establisheth may be changed."
