        "book_title": "Daniel",
        "book_short_title": "Dan.",
        "chapter_number": 6,
        "verse_number": 17,
        "verse_title": "Daniel 6:17",
        "verse_short_title": "Dan. 6:17",
        "scripture_text": "And a stone was brought, and laid upon the mouth of the den; and the king sealed it with his own signet, and with the signet of his lords; that the purpose might not be changed concerning Daniel."
