        "verse_title": "Daniel 6:20",
        "verse_short_title": "Dan. 6:20",
        "scripture_text": "And when he came to the den, he cried with a lamentable voice unto Daniel: and the king spake and said to Daniel, O Daniel, servant of the living God, is thy God, whom thou servest continually, able to deliver thee from the lions?"
