        "verse_title": "Daniel 6:22",
        "verse_short_title": "Dan. 6:22",
        "scripture_text": "My God hath sent his angel, and hath shut the lions' mouths, that they have not hurt me: forasmuch as before him innocency was found in me; and also before thee, O king, have I done no hurt."
