        "verse_title": "Daniel 6:26",
        "verse_short_title": "Dan. 6:26",
        "scripture_text": "I make a decree, That in every dominion of my kingdom men tremble and fear before the God of Daniel: for he is the living God, and steadfast for ever, and his kingdom that which shall not be destroyed, and his dominion shall be even unto the end."
