        "book_title": "Daniel",
        "book_short_title": "Dan.",
        "chapter_number": 7,
        "verse_number": 1,
        "verse_title": "Daniel 7:1",
        "verse_short_title": "Dan. 7:1",
        "scripture_text": "In the first year of Belshazzar king of Babylon Daniel had a dream and visions of his head upon his bed: then he wrote the dream, and told the sum of the matters."
