        "verse_title": "Daniel 7:4",
        "verse_short_title": "Dan. 7:4",
        "scripture_text": "The first was like a lion, and had eagle's wings: I beheld till the wings thereof were plucked, and it was lifted up from the earth, and made stand upon the feet as a man, and a man's heart was given to it."
