        "book_title": "Daniel",
        "book_short_title": "Dan.",
        "chapter_number": 7,
        "verse_number": 5,
        "verse_title": "Daniel 7:5",
        "verse_short_title": "Dan. 7:5",
        "scripture_text": "And behold another beast, a second, like to a bear, and it raised up itself on one side, and it had three ribs in the mouth of it between the teeth of it: and they said thus unto it, Arise, devour much flesh."
