        "book_title": "Daniel",
        "book_short_title": "Dan.",
        "chapter_number": 7,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Daniel 7:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Dan. 7:6",
        "scripture_text": "After this I beheld, and lo another, like a leopard, which had upon the back of it four wings of a fowl; the beast had also four heads; and dominion was given to it."
