        "book_short_title": "Dan.",
        "chapter_number": 7,
        "verse_number": 28,
        "verse_title": "Daniel 7:28",
        "verse_short_title": "Dan. 7:28",
        "scripture_text": "Hitherto is the end of the matter. As for me Daniel, my cogitations much troubled me, and my countenance changed in me: but I kept the matter in my heart."
