        "chapter_number": 8,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Daniel 8:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Dan. 8:6",
        "scripture_text": "And he came to the ram that had two horns, which I had seen standing before the river, and ran unto him in the fury of his power."
