        "book_title": "Nahum",
        "book_short_title": "Nahum",
        "chapter_number": 2,
        "verse_number": 13,
        "verse_title": "Nahum 2:13",
        "verse_short_title": "Nahum 2:13",
        "scripture_text": "Behold, I am against thee, saith the Lord of hosts, and I will burn her chariots in the smoke, and the sword shall devour thy young lions: and I will cut off thy prey from the earth, and the voice of thy messengers shall no more be heard."
