        "verse_number": 19,
        "verse_title": "Nahum 3:19",
        "verse_short_title": "Nahum 3:19",
        "scripture_text": "There is no healing of thy bruise; thy wound is grievous: all that hear the bruit of thee shall clap the hands over thee: for upon whom hath not thy wickedness passed continually?"
