        "book_title": "Habakkuk",
        "book_short_title": "Hab.",
        "chapter_number": 3,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Habakkuk 3:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Hab. 3:6",
        "scripture_text": "He stood, and measured the earth: he beheld, and drove asunder the nations; and the everlasting mountains were scattered, the perpetual hills did bow: his ways are everlasting."
