        "book_title": "Zephaniah",
        "book_short_title": "Zeph.",
        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 10,
        "verse_title": "Zephaniah 1:10",
        "verse_short_title": "Zeph. 1:10",
        "scripture_text": "And it shall come to pass in that day, saith the Lord, that there shall be the noise of a cry from the fish gate, and an howling from the second, and a great crashing from the hills."
