        "verse_number": 11,
        "verse_title": "Zephaniah 1:11",
        "verse_short_title": "Zeph. 1:11",
        "scripture_text": "Howl, ye inhabitants of Maktesh, for all the merchant people are cut down; all they that bear silver are cut off."
