        "volume_title": "Old Testament",
        "book_title": "Zephaniah",
        "book_short_title": "Zeph.",
        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 12,
        "verse_title": "Zephaniah 1:12",
        "verse_short_title": "Zeph. 1:12",
        "scripture_text": "And it shall come to pass at that time, that I will search Jerusalem with candles, and punish the men that are settled on their lees: that say in their heart, The Lord will not do good, neither will he do evil."
