        "book_title": "Zephaniah",
        "book_short_title": "Zeph.",
        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 13,
        "verse_title": "Zephaniah 1:13",
        "verse_short_title": "Zeph. 1:13",
        "scripture_text": "Therefore their goods shall become a booty, and their houses a desolation: they shall also build houses, but not inhabit them; and they shall plant vineyards, but not drink the wine thereof."
