        "book_short_title": "Matt.",
        "chapter_number": 12,
        "verse_number": 24,
        "verse_title": "Matthew 12:24",
        "verse_short_title": "Matt. 12:24",
        "scripture_text": "But when the Pharisees heard it, they said, This fellow doth not cast out devils, but by Beelzebub the prince of the devils."
