        "book_title": "Matthew",
        "book_short_title": "Matt.",
        "chapter_number": 12,
        "verse_number": 25,
        "verse_title": "Matthew 12:25",
        "verse_short_title": "Matt. 12:25",
        "scripture_text": "And Jesus knew their thoughts, and said unto them, Every kingdom divided against itself is brought to desolation; and every city or house divided against itself shall not stand:"
