        "verse_title": "Matthew 23:34",
        "verse_short_title": "Matt. 23:34",
        "scripture_text": "Wherefore, behold, I send unto you prophets, and wise men, and scribes: and some of them ye shall kill and crucify; and some of them shall ye scourge in your synagogues, and persecute them from city to city:"
