        "book_title": "Luke",
        "book_short_title": "Luke",
        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 36,
        "verse_title": "Luke 1:36",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 1:36",
        "scripture_text": "And, behold, thy cousin Elisabeth, she hath also conceived a son in her old age: and this is the sixth month with her, who was called barren."
