        "book_title": "Luke",
        "book_short_title": "Luke",
        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 38,
        "verse_title": "Luke 1:38",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 1:38",
        "scripture_text": "And Mary said, Behold the handmaid of the Lord; be it unto me according to thy word. And the angel departed from her."
