        "verse_number": 41,
        "verse_title": "Luke 1:41",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 1:41",
        "scripture_text": "And it came to pass, that, when Elisabeth heard the salutation of Mary, the babe leaped in her womb; and Elisabeth was filled with the Holy Ghost:"
