        "book_title": "Luke",
        "book_short_title": "Luke",
        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 42,
        "verse_title": "Luke 1:42",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 1:42",
        "scripture_text": "And she spake out with a loud voice, and said, Blessed art thou among women, and blessed is the fruit of thy womb."
