        "book_title": "Luke",
        "book_short_title": "Luke",
        "chapter_number": 7,
        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "Luke 7:4",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 7:4",
        "scripture_text": "And when they came to Jesus, they besought him instantly, saying, That he was worthy for whom he should do this:"
