        "volume_title": "New Testament",
        "book_title": "Luke",
        "book_short_title": "Luke",
        "chapter_number": 7,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Luke 7:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 7:6",
        "scripture_text": "Then Jesus went with them. And when he was now not far from the house, the centurion sent friends to him, saying unto him, Lord, trouble not thyself: for I am not worthy that thou shouldest enter under my roof:"
