        "verse_title": "Luke 7:37",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 7:37",
        "scripture_text": "And, behold, a woman in the city, which was a sinner, when she knew that Jesus sat at meat in the Pharisee's house, brought an alabaster box of ointment,"
