        "verse_number": 38,
        "verse_title": "Luke 7:38",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 7:38",
        "scripture_text": "And stood at his feet behind him weeping, and began to wash his feet with tears, and did wipe them with the hairs of her head, and kissed his feet, and anointed them with the ointment."
