        "volume_title": "New Testament",
        "book_title": "Luke",
        "book_short_title": "Luke",
        "chapter_number": 7,
        "verse_number": 39,
        "verse_title": "Luke 7:39",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 7:39",
        "scripture_text": "Now when the Pharisee which had bidden him saw it, he spake within himself, saying, This man, if he were a prophet, would have known who and what manner of woman this is that toucheth him: for she is a sinner."
