        "verse_number": 44,
        "verse_title": "Luke 7:44",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 7:44",
        "scripture_text": "And he turned to the woman, and said unto Simon, Seest thou this woman? I entered into thine house, thou gavest me no water for my feet: but she hath washed my feet with tears, and wiped them with the hairs of her head."
