        "volume_title": "New Testament",
        "book_title": "Luke",
        "book_short_title": "Luke",
        "chapter_number": 8,
        "verse_number": 10,
        "verse_title": "Luke 8:10",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 8:10",
        "scripture_text": "And he said, Unto you it is given to know the mysteries of the kingdom of God: but to others in parables; that seeing they might not see, and hearing they might not understand."
