        "book_title": "Luke",
        "book_short_title": "Luke",
        "chapter_number": 8,
        "verse_number": 15,
        "verse_title": "Luke 8:15",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 8:15",
        "scripture_text": "But that on the good ground are they, which in an honest and good heart, having heard the word, keep it, and bring forth fruit with patience."
