        "verse_number": 15,
        "verse_title": "Luke 12:15",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 12:15",
        "scripture_text": "And he said unto them, Take heed, and beware of covetousness: for a man's life consisteth not in the abundance of the things which he possesseth."
