        "verse_number": 29,
        "verse_title": "Luke 15:29",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 15:29",
        "scripture_text": "And he answering said to his father, Lo, these many years do I serve thee, neither transgressed I at any time thy commandment: and yet thou never gavest me a kid, that I might make merry with my friends:"
