        "verse_number": 1,
        "verse_title": "Luke 16:1",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 16:1",
        "scripture_text": "And he said also unto his disciples, There was a certain rich man, which had a steward; and the same was accused unto him that he had wasted his goods."
