        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "Luke 16:2",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 16:2",
        "scripture_text": "And he called him, and said unto him, How is it that I hear this of thee? give an account of thy stewardship; for thou mayest be no longer steward."
