        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "Luke 16:3",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 16:3",
        "scripture_text": "Then the steward said within himself, What shall I do? for my lord taketh away from me the stewardship: I cannot dig; to beg I am ashamed."
