        "verse_title": "Luke 16:24",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 16:24",
        "scripture_text": "And he cried and said, Father Abraham, have mercy on me, and send Lazarus, that he may dip the tip of his finger in water, and cool my tongue; for I am tormented in this flame."
