        "verse_title": "Luke 21:25",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 21:25",
        "scripture_text": "And there shall be signs in the sun, and in the moon, and in the stars; and upon the earth distress of nations, with perplexity; the sea and the waves roaring;"
