        "verse_title": "Luke 21:34",
        "verse_short_title": "Luke 21:34",
        "scripture_text": "And take heed to yourselves, lest at any time your hearts be overcharged with surfeiting, and drunkenness, and cares of this life, and so that day come upon you unawares."
