        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "John 3:2",
        "verse_short_title": "John 3:2",
        "scripture_text": "The same came to Jesus by night, and said unto him, Rabbi, we know that thou art a teacher come from God: for no man can do these miracles that thou doest, except God be with him."
