        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "John 3:3",
        "verse_short_title": "John 3:3",
        "scripture_text": "Jesus answered and said unto him, Verily, verily, I say unto thee, Except a man be born again, he cannot see the kingdom of God."
