        "verse_number": 19,
        "verse_title": "John 5:19",
        "verse_short_title": "John 5:19",
        "scripture_text": "Then answered Jesus and said unto them, Verily, verily, I say unto you, The Son can do nothing of himself, but what he seeth the Father do: for what things soever he doeth, these also doeth the Son likewise."
