        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 23,
        "verse_title": "John 5:23",
        "verse_short_title": "John 5:23",
        "scripture_text": "That all men should honour the Son, even as they honour the Father. He that honoureth not the Son honoureth not the Father which hath sent him."
