        "verse_number": 24,
        "verse_title": "John 5:24",
        "verse_short_title": "John 5:24",
        "scripture_text": "Verily, verily, I say unto you, He that heareth my word, and believeth on him that sent me, hath everlasting life, and shall not come into condemnation; but is passed from death unto life."
