        "book_short_title": "John",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 30,
        "verse_title": "John 5:30",
        "verse_short_title": "John 5:30",
        "scripture_text": "I can of mine own self do nothing: as I hear, I judge: and my judgment is just; because I seek not mine own will, but the will of the Father which hath sent me."
