        "verse_number": 36,
        "verse_title": "John 5:36",
        "verse_short_title": "John 5:36",
        "scripture_text": "But I have greater witness than that of John: for the works which the Father hath given me to finish, the same works that I do, bear witness of me, that the Father hath sent me."
