        "verse_title": "John 7:28",
        "verse_short_title": "John 7:28",
        "scripture_text": "Then cried Jesus in the temple as he taught, saying, Ye both know me, and ye know whence I am: and I am not come of myself, but he that sent me is true, whom ye know not."
