        "book_short_title": "John",
        "chapter_number": 8,
        "verse_number": 7,
        "verse_title": "John 8:7",
        "verse_short_title": "John 8:7",
        "scripture_text": "So when they continued asking him, he lifted up himself, and said unto them, He that is without sin among you, let him first cast a stone at her."
