        "verse_title": "John 8:14",
        "verse_short_title": "John 8:14",
        "scripture_text": "Jesus answered and said unto them, Though I bear record of myself, yet my record is true: for I know whence I came, and whither I go; but ye cannot tell whence I come, and whither I go."
