        "book_title": "Acts",
        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 29,
        "verse_title": "Acts 5:29",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 5:29",
        "scripture_text": "Then Peter and the other apostles answered and said, We ought to obey God rather than men."
