        "verse_number": 36,
        "verse_title": "Acts 5:36",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 5:36",
        "scripture_text": "For before these days rose up Theudas, boasting himself to be somebody; to whom a number of men, about four hundred, joined themselves: who was slain; and all, as many as obeyed him, were scattered, and brought to nought."
