        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 13,
        "verse_number": 29,
        "verse_title": "Acts 13:29",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 13:29",
        "scripture_text": "And when they had fulfilled all that was written of him, they took him down from the tree, and laid him in a sepulchre."
