        "verse_title": "Acts 13:33",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 13:33",
        "scripture_text": "God hath fulfilled the same unto us their children, in that he hath raised up Jesus again; as it is also written in the second psalm, Thou art my Son, this day have I begotten thee."
