        "verse_number": 36,
        "verse_title": "Acts 13:36",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 13:36",
        "scripture_text": "For David, after he had served his own generation by the will of God, fell on sleep, and was laid unto his fathers, and saw corruption:"
