        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 14,
        "verse_number": 17,
        "verse_title": "Acts 14:17",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 14:17",
        "scripture_text": "Nevertheless he left not himself without witness, in that he did good, and gave us rain from heaven, and fruitful seasons, filling our hearts with food and gladness."
