        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "Acts 15:2",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 15:2",
        "scripture_text": "When therefore Paul and Barnabas had no small dissension and disputation with them, they determined that Paul and Barnabas, and certain other of them, should go up to Jerusalem unto the apostles and elders about this question."
