        "book_title": "Acts",
        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 15,
        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "Acts 15:3",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 15:3",
        "scripture_text": "And being brought on their way by the church, they passed through Phenice and Samaria, declaring the conversion of the Gentiles: and they caused great joy unto all the brethren."
