        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 15,
        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "Acts 15:4",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 15:4",
        "scripture_text": "And when they were come to Jerusalem, they were received of the church, and of the apostles and elders, and they declared all things that God had done with them."
