        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 15,
        "verse_number": 20,
        "verse_title": "Acts 15:20",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 15:20",
        "scripture_text": "But that we write unto them, that they abstain from pollutions of idols, and from fornication, and from things strangled, and from blood."
