        "book_title": "Acts",
        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 15,
        "verse_number": 22,
        "verse_title": "Acts 15:22",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 15:22",
        "scripture_text": "Then pleased it the apostles and elders, with the whole church, to send chosen men of their own company to Antioch with Paul and Barnabas; namely, Judas surnamed Barsabas, and Silas, chief men among the brethren:"
