        "verse_number": 24,
        "verse_title": "Acts 15:24",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 15:24",
        "scripture_text": "Forasmuch as we have heard, that certain which went out from us have troubled you with words, subverting your souls, saying, Ye must be circumcised, and keep the law: to whom we gave no such commandment:"
