        "book_title": "Acts",
        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 16,
        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "Acts 16:3",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 16:3",
        "scripture_text": "Him would Paul have to go forth with him; and took and circumcised him because of the Jews which were in those quarters: for they knew all that his father was a Greek."
