        "verse_number": 19,
        "verse_title": "Acts 17:19",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 17:19",
        "scripture_text": "And they took him, and brought him unto Areopagus, saying, May we know what this new doctrine, whereof thou speakest, is?"
