        "verse_number": 22,
        "verse_title": "Acts 17:22",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 17:22",
        "scripture_text": "Then Paul stood in the midst of Mars' hill, and said, Ye men of Athens, I perceive that in all things ye are too superstitious."
