        "verse_title": "Acts 17:23",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 17:23",
        "scripture_text": "For as I passed by, and beheld your devotions, I found an altar with this inscription, To the Unknown God. Whom therefore ye ignorantly worship, him declare I unto you."
