        "book_title": "Acts",
        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 21,
        "verse_number": 13,
        "verse_title": "Acts 21:13",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 21:13",
        "scripture_text": "Then Paul answered, What mean ye to weep and to break mine heart? for I am ready not to be bound only, but also to die at Jerusalem for the name of the Lord Jesus."
