        "book_title": "Acts",
        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 21,
        "verse_number": 14,
        "verse_title": "Acts 21:14",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 21:14",
        "scripture_text": "And when he would not be persuaded, we ceased, saying, The will of the Lord be done."
