        "verse_number": 20,
        "verse_title": "Acts 21:20",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 21:20",
        "scripture_text": "And when they heard it, they glorified the Lord, and said unto him, Thou seest, brother, how many thousands of Jews there are which believe; and they are all zealous of the law:"
