        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 21,
        "verse_number": 28,
        "verse_title": "Acts 21:28",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 21:28",
        "scripture_text": "Crying out, Men of Israel, help: This is the man, that teacheth all men every where against the people, and the law, and this place: and further brought Greeks also into the temple, and hath polluted this holy place."
