        "verse_number": 32,
        "verse_title": "Acts 21:32",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 21:32",
        "scripture_text": "Who immediately took soldiers and centurions, and ran down unto them: and when they saw the chief captain and the soldiers, they left beating of Paul."
