        "chapter_number": 21,
        "verse_number": 37,
        "verse_title": "Acts 21:37",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 21:37",
        "scripture_text": "And as Paul was to be led into the castle, he said unto the chief captain, May I speak unto thee? Who said, Canst thou speak Greek?"
