        "verse_number": 38,
        "verse_title": "Acts 21:38",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 21:38",
        "scripture_text": "Art not thou that Egyptian, which before these days madest an uproar, and leddest out into the wilderness four thousand men that were murderers?"
