        "book_title": "Acts",
        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 22,
        "verse_number": 5,
        "verse_title": "Acts 22:5",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 22:5",
        "scripture_text": "As also the high priest doth bear me witness, and all the estate of the elders: from whom also I received letters unto the brethren, and went to Damascus, to bring them which were there bound unto Jerusalem, for to be punished."
