        "book_title": "Acts",
        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 22,
        "verse_number": 6,
        "verse_title": "Acts 22:6",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 22:6",
        "scripture_text": "And it came to pass, that, as I made my journey, and was come nigh unto Damascus about noon, suddenly there shone from heaven a great light round about me."
