        "verse_number": 8,
        "verse_title": "Acts 22:8",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 22:8",
        "scripture_text": "And I answered, Who art thou, Lord? And he said unto me, I am Jesus of Nazareth, whom thou persecutest."
