        "verse_title": "Acts 22:10",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 22:10",
        "scripture_text": "And I said, What shall I do, Lord? And the Lord said unto me, Arise, and go into Damascus; and there it shall be told thee of all things which are appointed for thee to do."
