        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 26,
        "verse_number": 29,
        "verse_title": "Acts 26:29",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 26:29",
        "scripture_text": "And Paul said, I would to God, that not only thou, but also all that hear me this day, were both almost, and altogether such as I am, except these bonds."
