        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 26,
        "verse_number": 30,
        "verse_title": "Acts 26:30",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 26:30",
        "scripture_text": "And when he had thus spoken, the king rose up, and the governor, and Bernice, and they that sat with them:"
