        "volume_title": "New Testament",
        "book_title": "Acts",
        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 27,
        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "Acts 27:3",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 27:3",
        "scripture_text": "And the next day we touched at Sidon. And Julius courteously entreated Paul, and gave him liberty to go unto his friends to refresh himself."
