        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 27,
        "verse_number": 7,
        "verse_title": "Acts 27:7",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 27:7",
        "scripture_text": "And when we had sailed slowly many days, and scarce were come over against Cnidus, the wind not suffering us, we sailed under Crete, over against Salmone;"
