        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 27,
        "verse_number": 9,
        "verse_title": "Acts 27:9",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 27:9",
        "scripture_text": "Now when much time was spent, and when sailing was now dangerous, because the fast was now already past, Paul admonished them,"
