        "verse_number": 10,
        "verse_title": "Acts 27:10",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 27:10",
        "scripture_text": "And said unto them, Sirs, I perceive that this voyage will be with hurt and much damage, not only of the lading and ship, but also of our lives."
