        "book_title": "Acts",
        "book_short_title": "Acts",
        "chapter_number": 27,
        "verse_number": 13,
        "verse_title": "Acts 27:13",
        "verse_short_title": "Acts 27:13",
        "scripture_text": "And when the south wind blew softly, supposing that they had obtained their purpose, loosing thence, they sailed close by Crete."
