        "book_short_title": "1 Cor.",
        "chapter_number": 14,
        "verse_number": 12,
        "verse_title": "1 Corinthians 14:12",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Cor. 14:12",
        "scripture_text": "Even so ye, forasmuch as ye are zealous of spiritual gifts, seek that ye may excel to the edifying of the church."
