        "chapter_number": 14,
        "verse_number": 19,
        "verse_title": "1 Corinthians 14:19",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Cor. 14:19",
        "scripture_text": "Yet in the church I had rather speak five words with my understanding, that by my voice I might teach others also, than ten thousand words in an unknown tongue."
