        "verse_title": "1 Corinthians 14:22",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Cor. 14:22",
        "scripture_text": "Wherefore tongues are for a sign, not to them that believe, but to them that believe not: but prophesying serveth not for them that believe not, but for them which believe."
