        "book_short_title": "1 Cor.",
        "chapter_number": 14,
        "verse_number": 24,
        "verse_title": "1 Corinthians 14:24",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Cor. 14:24",
        "scripture_text": "But if all prophesy, and there come in one that believeth not, or one unlearned, he is convinced of all, he is judged of all:"
