        "verse_title": "1 Corinthians 14:26",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Cor. 14:26",
        "scripture_text": "How is it then, brethren? when ye come together, every one of you hath a psalm, hath a doctrine, hath a tongue, hath a revelation, hath an interpretation. Let all things be done unto edifying."
