        "book_short_title": "1 Tim.",
        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "1 Timothy 1:3",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Tim. 1:3",
        "scripture_text": "As I besought thee to abide still at Ephesus, when I went into Macedonia, that thou mightest charge some that they teach no other doctrine,"
