        "book_title": "1 Timothy",
        "book_short_title": "1 Tim.",
        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "1 Timothy 1:4",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Tim. 1:4",
        "scripture_text": "Neither give heed to fables and endless genealogies, which minister questions, rather than godly edifying which is in faith: so do."
