        "book_title": "1 Timothy",
        "book_short_title": "1 Tim.",
        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 13,
        "verse_title": "1 Timothy 1:13",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Tim. 1:13",
        "scripture_text": "Who was before a blasphemer, and a persecutor, and injurious: but I obtained mercy, because I did it ignorantly in unbelief."
