        "verse_title": "1 Timothy 1:16",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Tim. 1:16",
        "scripture_text": "Howbeit for this cause I obtained mercy, that in me first Jesus Christ might shew forth all longsuffering, for a pattern to them which should hereafter believe on him to life everlasting."
