        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "1 Timothy 5:4",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Tim. 5:4",
        "scripture_text": "But if any widow have children or nephews, let them learn first to shew piety at home, and to requite their parents: for that is good and acceptable before God."
