        "book_short_title": "1 Tim.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 5,
        "verse_title": "1 Timothy 5:5",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Tim. 5:5",
        "scripture_text": "Now she that is a widow indeed, and desolate, trusteth in God, and continueth in supplications and prayers night and day."
