        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 8,
        "verse_title": "1 Timothy 5:8",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Tim. 5:8",
        "scripture_text": "But if any provide not for his own, and specially for those of his own house, he hath denied the faith, and is worse than an infidel."
