        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 9,
        "verse_title": "1 Timothy 5:9",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Tim. 5:9",
        "scripture_text": "Let not a widow be taken into the number under threescore years old, having been the wife of one man,"
