        "verse_number": 10,
        "verse_title": "1 Timothy 5:10",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Tim. 5:10",
        "scripture_text": "Well reported of for good works; if she have brought up children, if she have lodged strangers, if she have washed the saints' feet, if she have relieved the afflicted, if she have diligently followed every good work."
