        "book_short_title": "1 Tim.",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 13,
        "verse_title": "1 Timothy 5:13",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Tim. 5:13",
        "scripture_text": "And withal they learn to be idle, wandering about from house to house; and not only idle, but tattlers also and busybodies, speaking things which they ought not."
