        "book_title": "2 Timothy",
        "book_short_title": "2 Tim.",
        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 5,
        "verse_title": "2 Timothy 1:5",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Tim. 1:5",
        "scripture_text": "When I call to remembrance the unfeigned faith that is in thee, which dwelt first in thy grandmother Lois, and thy mother Eunice; and I am persuaded that in thee also."
