        "book_short_title": "2 Tim.",
        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 10,
        "verse_title": "2 Timothy 1:10",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Tim. 1:10",
        "scripture_text": "But is now made manifest by the appearing of our Saviour Jesus Christ, who hath abolished death, and hath brought life and immortality to light through the gospel:"
