        "verse_title": "2 Timothy 1:12",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Tim. 1:12",
        "scripture_text": "For the which cause I also suffer these things: nevertheless I am not ashamed: for I know whom I have believed, and am persuaded that he is able to keep that which I have committed unto him against that day."
