        "verse_title": "2 Timothy 1:18",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Tim. 1:18",
        "scripture_text": "The Lord grant unto him that he may find mercy of the Lord in that day: and in how many things he ministered unto me at Ephesus, thou knowest very well."
