        "book_short_title": "2 Tim.",
        "chapter_number": 2,
        "verse_number": 17,
        "verse_title": "2 Timothy 2:17",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Tim. 2:17",
        "scripture_text": "And their word will eat as doth a canker: of whom is Hymenaeus and Philetus;"
