        "book_short_title": "2 Tim.",
        "chapter_number": 2,
        "verse_number": 19,
        "verse_title": "2 Timothy 2:19",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Tim. 2:19",
        "scripture_text": "Nevertheless the foundation of God standeth sure, having this seal, The Lord knoweth them that are his. And, Let every one that nameth the name of Christ depart from iniquity."
