        "book_short_title": "2 Tim.",
        "chapter_number": 2,
        "verse_number": 21,
        "verse_title": "2 Timothy 2:21",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Tim. 2:21",
        "scripture_text": "If a man therefore purge himself from these, he shall be a vessel unto honour, sanctified, and meet for the master's use, and prepared unto every good work."
