        "book_title": "2 Timothy",
        "book_short_title": "2 Tim.",
        "chapter_number": 3,
        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "2 Timothy 3:3",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Tim. 3:3",
        "scripture_text": "Without natural affection, trucebreakers, false accusers, incontinent, fierce, despisers of those that are good,"
