        "volume_title": "New Testament",
        "book_title": "James",
        "book_short_title": "James",
        "chapter_number": 2,
        "verse_number": 25,
        "verse_title": "James 2:25",
        "verse_short_title": "James 2:25",
        "scripture_text": "Likewise also was not Rahab the harlot justified by works, when she had received the messengers, and had sent them out another way?"
