        "book_title": "James",
        "book_short_title": "James",
        "chapter_number": 3,
        "verse_number": 17,
        "verse_title": "James 3:17",
        "verse_short_title": "James 3:17",
        "scripture_text": "But the wisdom that is from above is first pure, then peaceable, gentle, and easy to be entreated, full of mercy and good fruits, without partiality, and without hypocrisy."
