        "verse_number": 11,
        "verse_title": "James 4:11",
        "verse_short_title": "James 4:11",
        "scripture_text": "Speak not evil one of another, brethren. He that speaketh evil of his brother, and judgeth his brother, speaketh evil of the law, and judgeth the law: but if thou judge the law, thou art not a doer of the law, but a judge."
