        "volume_title": "New Testament",
        "book_title": "James",
        "book_short_title": "James",
        "chapter_number": 4,
        "verse_number": 13,
        "verse_title": "James 4:13",
        "verse_short_title": "James 4:13",
        "scripture_text": "Go to now, ye that say, To day or to morrow we will go into such a city, and continue there a year, and buy and sell, and get gain:"
