        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "James 5:3",
        "verse_short_title": "James 5:3",
        "scripture_text": "Your gold and silver is cankered; and the rust of them shall be a witness against you, and shall eat your flesh as it were fire. Ye have heaped treasure together for the last days."
