        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "James 5:4",
        "verse_short_title": "James 5:4",
        "scripture_text": "Behold, the hire of the labourers who have reaped down your fields, which is of you kept back by fraud, crieth: and the cries of them which have reaped are entered into the ears of the Lord of sabaoth."
