        "verse_title": "James 5:11",
        "verse_short_title": "James 5:11",
        "scripture_text": "Behold, we count them happy which endure. Ye have heard of the patience of Job, and have seen the end of the Lord; that the Lord is very pitiful, and of tender mercy."
