        "book_title": "James",
        "book_short_title": "James",
        "chapter_number": 5,
        "verse_number": 17,
        "verse_title": "James 5:17",
        "verse_short_title": "James 5:17",
        "scripture_text": "Elias was a man subject to like passions as we are, and he prayed earnestly that it might not rain: and it rained not on the earth by the space of three years and six months."
