        "book_title": "1 Peter",
        "book_short_title": "1 Pet.",
        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 4,
        "verse_title": "1 Peter 1:4",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Pet. 1:4",
        "scripture_text": "To an inheritance incorruptible, and undefiled, and that fadeth not away, reserved in heaven for you,"
