        "book_title": "1 Peter",
        "book_short_title": "1 Pet.",
        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 8,
        "verse_title": "1 Peter 1:8",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Pet. 1:8",
        "scripture_text": "Whom having not seen, ye love; in whom, though now ye see him not, yet believing, ye rejoice with joy unspeakable and full of glory:"
