        "book_title": "1 Peter",
        "book_short_title": "1 Pet.",
        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 14,
        "verse_title": "1 Peter 1:14",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Pet. 1:14",
        "scripture_text": "As obedient children, not fashioning yourselves according to the former lusts in your ignorance:"
