        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 18,
        "verse_title": "1 Peter 1:18",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Pet. 1:18",
        "scripture_text": "Forasmuch as ye know that ye were not redeemed with corruptible things, as silver and gold, from your vain conversation received by tradition from your fathers;"
