        "book_title": "1 Peter",
        "book_short_title": "1 Pet.",
        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 21,
        "verse_title": "1 Peter 1:21",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Pet. 1:21",
        "scripture_text": "Who by him do believe in God, that raised him up from the dead, and gave him glory; that your faith and hope might be in God."
