        "book_title": "1 Peter",
        "book_short_title": "1 Pet.",
        "chapter_number": 1,
        "verse_number": 22,
        "verse_title": "1 Peter 1:22",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Pet. 1:22",
        "scripture_text": "Seeing ye have purified your souls in obeying the truth through the Spirit unto unfeigned love of the brethren, see that ye love one another with a pure heart fervently:"
