        "verse_title": "1 Peter 2:5",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Pet. 2:5",
        "scripture_text": "Ye also, as lively stones, are built up a spiritual house, an holy priesthood, to offer up spiritual sacrifices, acceptable to God by Jesus Christ."
