        "book_title": "1 Nephi",
        "book_short_title": "1 Ne.",
        "chapter_number": 13,
        "verse_number": 18,
        "verse_title": "1 Nephi 13:18",
        "verse_short_title": "1 Ne. 13:18",
        "scripture_text": "And I beheld that the power of God was with them, and also that the wrath of God was upon all those that were gathered together against them to battle."
