        "chapter_number": 13,
        "verse_number": 14,
        "verse_title": "2 Nephi 13:14",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Ne. 13:14",
        "scripture_text": "The Lord will enter into judgment with the ancients of his people and the princes thereof; for ye have eaten up the vineyard and the spoil of the poor in your houses."
