        "verse_number": 16,
        "verse_title": "2 Nephi 13:16",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Ne. 13:16",
        "scripture_text": "Moreover, the Lord saith: Because the daughters of Zion are haughty, and walk with stretched-forth necks and wanton eyes, walking and mincing as they go, and making a tinkling with their feet--"
