        "verse_short_title": "2 Ne. 13:24",
        "scripture_text": "And it shall come to pass, instead of sweet smell there shall be stink; and instead of a girdle, a rent; and instead of well set hair, baldness; and instead of a stomacher, a girding of sackcloth; burning instead of beauty."
