        "verse_title": "2 Nephi 19:21",
        "verse_short_title": "2 Ne. 19:21",
        "scripture_text": "Manasseh, Ephraim; and Ephraim, Manasseh; they together shall be against Judah. For all this his anger is not turned away, but his hand is stretched out still."
