        "verse_title": "3 Nephi 13:16",
        "verse_short_title": "3 Ne. 13:16",
        "scripture_text": "Moreover, when ye fast be not as the hypocrites, of a sad countenance, for they disfigure their faces that they may appear unto men to fast. Verily I say unto you, they have their reward."
