        "book_title": "3 Nephi",
        "book_short_title": "3 Ne.",
        "chapter_number": 13,
        "verse_number": 22,
        "verse_title": "3 Nephi 13:22",
        "verse_short_title": "3 Ne. 13:22",
        "scripture_text": "The light of the body is the eye; if, therefore, thine eye be single, thy whole body shall be full of light."
