        "book_title": "3 Nephi",
        "book_short_title": "3 Ne.",
        "chapter_number": 13,
        "verse_number": 34,
        "verse_title": "3 Nephi 13:34",
        "verse_short_title": "3 Ne. 13:34",
        "scripture_text": "Take therefore no thought for the morrow, for the morrow shall take thought for the things of itself. Sufficient is the day unto the evil thereof."
