        "book_title": "3 Nephi",
        "book_short_title": "3 Ne.",
        "chapter_number": 14,
        "verse_number": 17,
        "verse_title": "3 Nephi 14:17",
        "verse_short_title": "3 Ne. 14:17",
        "scripture_text": "Even so every good tree bringeth forth good fruit; but a corrupt tree bringeth forth evil fruit."
