        "verse_title": "Doctrine and Covenants 77:10",
        "verse_short_title": "D&C 77:10",
        "scripture_text": "Q. What time are the things spoken of in this chapter to be accomplished? A. They are to be accomplished in the sixth thousand years, or the opening of the sixth seal."
