        "verse_title": "Doctrine and Covenants 110:2",
        "verse_short_title": "D&C 110:2",
        "scripture_text": "We saw the Lord standing upon the breastwork of the pulpit, before us; and under his feet was a paved work of pure gold, in color like amber."
