        "chapter_number": 110,
        "verse_number": 3,
        "verse_title": "Doctrine and Covenants 110:3",
        "verse_short_title": "D&C 110:3",
        "scripture_text": "His eyes were as a flame of fire; the hair of his head was white like the pure snow; his countenance shone above the brightness of the sun; and his voice was as the sound of the rushing of great waters, even the voice of Jehovah, saying:"
