        "verse_title": "Doctrine and Covenants 110:10",
        "verse_short_title": "D&C 110:10",
        "scripture_text": "And the fame of this house shall spread to foreign lands; and this is the beginning of the blessing which shall be poured out upon the heads of my people. Even so. Amen."
