        "book_title": "Doctrine and Covenants",
        "book_short_title": "D&C",
        "chapter_number": 110,
        "verse_number": 13,
        "verse_title": "Doctrine and Covenants 110:13",
        "verse_short_title": "D&C 110:13",
        "scripture_text": "After this vision had closed, another great and glorious vision burst upon us; for Elijah the prophet, who was taken to heaven without tasting death, stood before us, and said:"
