        "chapter_number": 110,
        "verse_number": 15,
        "verse_title": "Doctrine and Covenants 110:15",
        "verse_short_title": "D&C 110:15",
        "scripture_text": "To turn the hearts of the fathers to the children, and the children to the fathers, lest the whole earth be smitten with a curse--"
