        "verse_title": "Doctrine and Covenants 112:7",
        "verse_short_title": "D&C 112:7",
        "scripture_text": "Therefore, gird up thy loins for the work. Let thy feet be shod also, for thou art chosen, and thy path lieth among the mountains, and among many nations."
