        "book_title": "Doctrine and Covenants",
        "book_short_title": "D&C",
        "chapter_number": 112,
        "verse_number": 9,
        "verse_title": "Doctrine and Covenants 112:9",
        "verse_short_title": "D&C 112:9",
        "scripture_text": "Thy voice shall be a rebuke unto the transgressor; and at thy rebuke let the tongue of the slanderer cease its perverseness."
