        "book_title": "Doctrine and Covenants",
        "book_short_title": "D&C",
        "chapter_number": 112,
        "verse_number": 19,
        "verse_title": "Doctrine and Covenants 112:19",
        "verse_short_title": "D&C 112:19",
        "scripture_text": "Wherefore, whithersoever they shall send you, go ye, and I will be with you; and in whatsoever place ye shall proclaim my name an effectual door shall be opened unto you, that they may receive my word."
