        "book_title": "Doctrine and Covenants",
        "book_short_title": "D&C",
        "chapter_number": 137,
        "verse_number": 2,
        "verse_title": "Doctrine and Covenants 137:2",
        "verse_short_title": "D&C 137:2",
        "scripture_text": "I saw the transcendent beauty of the gate through which the heirs of that kingdom will enter, which was like unto circling flames of fire;"
