        "verse_title": "Abraham 4:24",
        "verse_short_title": "Abr. 4:24",
        "scripture_text": "And the Gods prepared the earth to bring forth the living creature after his kind, cattle and creeping things, and beasts of the earth after their kind; and it was so, as they had said."
