        "verse_title": "Abraham 4:25",
        "verse_short_title": "Abr. 4:25",
        "scripture_text": "And the Gods organized the earth to bring forth the beasts after their kind, and cattle after their kind, and every thing that creepeth upon the earth after its kind; and the Gods saw they would obey."
