        "verse_number": 17,
        "verse_title": "Abraham 5:17",
        "verse_short_title": "Abr. 5:17",
        "scripture_text": "And Adam said: This was bone of my bones, and flesh of my flesh; now she shall be called Woman, because she was taken out of man;"
